<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- SUKWA BIBLE TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="toc1">Amasyu Amisa agha Yesu Kilisitu gho ghasimbiwe nu Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMASYU AMISA AGHA YESU KILISITU GHO GHASIMBIWE NU</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANI</para>
  <para style="imt">UKWANDA</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Amasyu amisa ukuyana nu Yohani</char> lyo limo muma buku folo mu Lufingo ulupya gho ghakulingannya nu bumi bwa Yesu Kilisitu. Ibuku lyo likwitisiwa sona ukuti Amasyu Amisa. Likasimbiwa bo u Yesu afwa nu Matayi, u Maliko, u Luka nu Yohani. Amasyu amisa ukuyana nu Yohani ghakasimbiwa nu mutumiwa u Yohani bo u Yesu apapiwa mu chinja cha 90. Napo I buku ili litakuyugha ukuti weyo akasimba, akasimbile kakuyana bubu nu kalata uwakwanda uwa Yohani, uwa bubili nuwa butatu. Abasimbi bamo abakale bakumubika u Yohani ukwikala mukaya akakulu aka Efeso, ko pakabalilo aka chikuyana ukuti ibuku ili likasimbiwa mu Efeso. U Yohani akuyugha umwakwifwika nifundo ya libuku yakubafwa abandu ukusubila ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu, u Mwana wa Chala umumi (20.31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pa kusubila sisisi tubaghile pakuba nu bumi mwilita lyake. Ibuku lili likasimbiwa kubosi aba Yuda nabo te balongosi ba Bayuda. Amasyu amisa agha Yohani ghapambaniteko na mu buku matatu agha Masyu Amisa. Akulimbana ngani ni fiswigho fyo u Yesu akabomba sona atakasimba ngani nisya fyili fyake. Nafimo fyo fikabombiwa ngati ukosiwa kwa Yesu nu kughelwa mulungalangala sona fitakasimbiwa mu masyu amisa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ifya mukati:</para>
  <para style="io1">U Yohani akwanda na Masyu Amisa mu chaputala 1.1-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Po akasimba ngani nisya fyili ifingi fyo u Yesu akabomba 1.19—12.50.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ichinine akalongosola nifyakubombiwa ifingi mu bumi bwa Yesu Kilisitu fyo fikulongosya ukufwa nu kusyuka kwake 13.1—20.3.</para>
  <para style="io1">U Yohani akamalisya na masyu amisa mu chaputala 12 nu kuyugha nisya kabalilo ko akababonekela abandu bo asyuka ku bufwe sona napo akanda pakasimaba ibuku lyake</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha bumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Pabwandilo pakaba Amasyu, Amasyu ghakaba nu Chala sona Amasyu we Chala. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ukufuma pabwandilo umwene akaba nu Chala. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Fyosi ifindu fikapeliwa ukwendela mumwake, pala akasoba we yuyo ngali nachimo cho chikapeliwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mumwake mukaba ubumi, po ubumi bukaba bwelu bwa bandu bosi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Po ubwelu bukabalagha muchisi, loli ichisi chikapotwa pakufifa ubwelu bula.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Kukabako umundu yo akatumiwa nu Chala, yo ilita lyake akaba we Yohani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Akisa ngati we kamboni pakusimikisya nisya bwelu bula, umwakuti bosi basubile mumwake. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Umwene atakaba bwelu, loli akisa pa kusimikisya nisya bwelu. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ubwelu ubwanaloli bo bukababalila abandu bosi, bukisa muchisu chapasi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Yo akitisiwagha ukuti we Masyu akaba mu chisu chapasi, ichisu chapasi chikapeliwa ukwendela mumwake, loli ichisu chitakamumanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Akisila abandu ba muchisu chake, loli abandu bake batakamupokela. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Loli bosi bo bakamupokela nu kumusubila, akabapa ubulaghili pakuba bana ba Chala, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />pakuba bana ba Chala batakapapiwa ukuyana namo abana bakupapiliwa chifukwa cha bwighane bwa mundu, loli bakapapiliwa mwa Chala.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Po Amasyu ghakanduka ukuba mundu, nu kwikala mumwitu. Tukabutesya ubughindikiwa bwake, ubughindikiwa ubwa Mwana mwene, yo akafuma kwa Tata iswile nichisa nu bwanaloli.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />U Yohani akasimikisya nisya yuyo, nu kukolela ukuti, “Uyu weyo ngamuyughagha yo ngati, ‘Uyu weyo akungonga pa nyuma pangu, weyo we songo ngani ku une, akabako kale bo nune ngali ndapapiwe.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ukufuma mu kwisula ni chisa chake, twebosi tupokelite ulusayo pamwanya palunine. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Pakuti akatupa indaghilo ukwendela mwa Mozesi, ichisa nu bwanaloli fyo fikisa nu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Nayumo umundu yo amutesisyepo u Chala, loli u Mwana mwene, yo we Chala, sona akaba papipi ngani nu Wise, weyo akatufumbulila.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulusimikisyo lwa Yohani uwalosyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayi3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ulu lo lusimikisyo lwa Yohani, lo aba Yuda bakabatuma abalongosi ba baputi naba Levi aba mu Yelusalemu pakumulalusya u Yohani ukuti, “Imba we wenu?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Akitikisya, atakakana pakubamula, loli akayugha pa bwelu akati, “Une tene Kilisitu”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bakamulalusya bakati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Po we wenu? Imba we Eliya?” Akamula akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Awe tenene” Bakamulalusya sona bakati, “Imba we Musololi yula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Akabamula akati, “Awe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Po bakayugha ku kwake bakati, “Imba we wenu?” “Tubusye ubwanaloli pakuti tukulonda ukuti tubuke tubabusye bo bakatutuma. Imba uwe we mwenecho ukuti we wenu?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />U Yohani akabamula ukuyana na masyu gho umusololi u Yisaya akayugha ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Une ne lisyu lya mundu yo akukolela mungolongo ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Gholosya isila ya Malafyale!’”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Po abandumi bo bakatumiwa naba Falisayi, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />bakamulalusya u Yohani bakati, “Choni cho ukosya? Pala uwe te we Kilisitu, pamo te we Eliya, pamo te we musololi?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />U Yohani akabamula akati, “Une ngosya na misi ghene, loli pakati papinyu imilile yumo yo umwe mutamumenye, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />yo akwisa panyuma papangu, yo ndabaghile napo papala pakusatula utupinyilo twa sapato syake.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Syosi sisisi sikabombiwa mukaya ka Betaniya kubufumilo bwa lisuba ku lusoko lwa Yolodani, ko u Yohani akosyagha.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Mwana wa ng’osi uwa Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ilya ningelo lyake, u Yohani akamutesya u Yesu akwisa ku kwake, po akati, “Tesya u Mwana wa ng’osi uwa Chala, yo akufumya imbibi sya muchisu chapasi! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Yuyuyu weyo ngayughagha ukuti, ‘Umundu yo akwisa panyuma papangu, yo mukulu ngani ukungila une pakuti akabako kale bo nune ngali ndapapiwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Po nune ndakamumanya, loli pakuti une ngisa pakubosyagha na misi ghene, ukuti aba Izilayeli bamumanye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />U Yohani akasimikisya ukuti, “Ngatesya u Mbepo akwika ukufuma kumwanya ngati yo ngunda nukwikala papake.” <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Pope ndakamumanyagha ukuti we yuyo, loli u Chala yo akanduma pakosya na misi akambusya une akati, “Yo mukumutesya u Mbepo akwika nu kwikala papake, bo we yuyo akosya nu Mbepo Mwikemo.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Po une natesya nu kusimikisya” ukuti, “Uyu weyo Mwana wa Chala.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abamanyili ba bwandilo aba Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ilya ningelo lyake, u Yohani akimilila sona na bamanyili bake babili pabuyo bula bula. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Bo amutesya u Yesu akwenda pala pala, akati, “Tesya u Mwana wa ng’osi uwa Chala.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Abamanyili babili bakamwifwa akuyugha sisisi, po bakamukonga u Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />U Yesu akaghalabuka nu kubatesya bo bamukonga, akabalalusya akati, “Imba mukulonda choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bakamwamula bakati, “Wee Labi, (cho chikung’anamula ukuti Mumanyisi) Imba ukwikala kwighi?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Akabamula akati, “Twende mutesye.” Po bakabuka nawe nukuya pakutesya ko akikalagha, sona bakalinda nawe isiku lyosi lila lila pakuti kakaba kabalilo ka folo koloko aka panamasuba.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Weka uwa bandu babili, yo akifwa syo u Yohani akayughagha nukumukonga u Yesu akaba we Andeleya, uwamwabo wa Simoni Pitala. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Akanda tasi pakumwagha u Simoni u wamwabo nukumubusya ukuti, “Twamwagha u Mesiya” (cho chikung’amula ukuti Kilisitu.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Po akabuka nawe u Simoni kwa Yesu. U Yesu akamutesya numubusya ukuti, “Ilita lyako we Simoni u mwana wa Yohani, loli ukwisa pakwitisiwagha ukuti we Kefasi” (chikung’anamulo cha kefasi kokuti Pitala, lyo ko kuti ilyalabwe.)<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akamwitisya u Filipu nu Nataniyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ningelo lyake u Yesu akinong’ona ukubuka ku Galileya. Akamwagha u Filipu nukumubusya ukuti, “Ungonge.”<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />U Filipu akaba wa ku Betisayida, akaya ko u Andeleya nu Pitala bakikalagha. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />U Filipu akamwagha u Nataniyele nu kumubusya ukuti, “Twamwagha yo u Mozesi akasimba mwibuku lya ndaghilo, sona nayo abasololi bakasimba nisyake. We Yesu wa mu Nazaleti, u Mwana wa Jozefu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />U Nataniyele akalalusya akati, “Imba chingafuma chimo ichisa mu Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">U Filipu akamula akati, “Twende utesye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Bo u Yesu amutesya u Nataniyeli akwisa kukwake, akayugha akati, “Tesya umu Isilayeli uwabwanaloli. Mumwake mutalimo nabumo ubumyasi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />U Nataniyeli akamulalusya akati, “Wamanya buli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Ngakutesya bo wikile mukasundila ka likuyu, bo nu Filipu akali atakwitisisye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Po u Nataniyeli akamula akati, “Labi, uwe we Mwana wa Chala! We Malafyale wa Isilayeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />U Yesu akati, “Imba ukusubila chifukwa chakuti ngakubusya ukuti ngakutesya bo wikile mukasundila ka likuyu? Ukwisa pakutesya ifindu ifikulu ukukila pa ifi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Akayugha nawe akati, “Naloli ngubabusya ukuti mukwisa pakutesya kumwanya kwighukite, sona abandumi aba Chala bakukwela nu kwika pa Mwana wa Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Inyegha mukaya ka Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Bo ghakindapo amasiku mabili ku kaba inyegha mukaya aka Kana mubuyo bwa Galileya. Wepe ung’ina wa Yesu akabako kula kula, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />sona u Yesu na bamanyili bake bakitisiwa kunyegha yila. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Bo ubwalwa bwa mafilu bwamala, ung’ina wa Yesu akamubusya akati, “Ubwalwa bwa mafilu bwamala.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “We mukolo, choni cho ukumbusya sisi. Akabalilo kangu kakali katakwanite.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Umayi wa Yesu akababusya aba mbombo bala akati, “Bomba bubu chosi cho akubabusya.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Papipi bakabikapo isonda sya mabwe sikisi syo sitakaba namisi, syo aba yuda bakabombelagha pakusukusulila ukuyana nimiteto yabo iyakwiswepesya. Isonda yosi yikayana bubu nindobo fayivi pamo sikisi. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />U Yesu akababusya aba mbombo bala akati, “Isusya isonda isi na misi.” Bakisusya mupaka pamwanya. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Po akababusya akati, “Losulu semba amisi mupe usongo uwa lusekelo.” Po bakasemba amisi nukumupa, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />bo u songo wa lusekelo aghonja amisi, gho ghachenja ukuba bwalwa bwa mafilu. Atakamanya ko bukafuma, (loli abambombo bo bakasembelelagha amisi bakasimanya); Po u songo yula akamwitisya umwene nyegha, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />po akamubusya ukuti, “Mundu wesi pakwanda akubapa ubwalwa bwamafilu ubwisa, pala abandu bang’wa ngani, akubapa ubwalwa bwa mafilu ububibi, loli uwe wasungite ubwalwa bwa mafilu ubwisa mupaka ulu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />U Yesu akabomba chiswigho cha bwandilo mukaya ka Kana mu buyo bwa Galileya, mula mula momo akalangisya ubughindikiwa bwake, sona na bamanyili bake bakamusubila.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Panyuma pake akabuka mu Kapelinamu, poka nu mayi wake, naba wamwabo, na bamanyili bake nukwikala kula kula amasiku amapala bubu.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akuyiswepesya Inyumba ya Chala.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-17">Matayi21.1-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Bo akabalilo ka Ulusekelo lwa Pasaka lwa ba Yuda lwapalamila, u Yesu akabuka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Po mu Nyumba ya Chala akabagha abandu bakughulisya ing’ombe, ing’osi ni ngunda, sona akabagha bo bakachenjanagha indalama bikile pa tundalati. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Po u Yesu akapota ululisi pakuba lukomo, akabakisyamo bosi mu Nyumba ya Chala, poka ni ng’osi ni ng’ombe syabo. Akapenulannya utundalati twa bo bakachenjanagha indalama, sona indalama syabo sikanyambana. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Po akababusya bo bakughulisya ingunda akati, “Fifumyemo ifindu ifi muno. Mutakayipele inyumba ya Tata ukuba munalo!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Abamanyili bake bakakumbukila Amasimbo aghakuti, “Ulweke lyangu pa nyumba yako lukwaka mumwangu ngati mulilo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Abayuda bakamulalusya u Yesu bakati, “Chiswigho chiki cho ungabomba ukutulangisya ukuti uli namaka agha kubombela sisisi?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Mongolannya Inyumba ya Chala iyi, po ngwisa pakuyisenga sona amasiku matatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Po aba longosi ba Chiyuda bakamubusya bakati, “Inyumba ya Chala yikasenya ifinja fote sikisi pakuti yisengiwe, Imba uwe ungasenga pamasiku matatu bubu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Loli Inyumba ya Chala yo u Yesu akayughagha, ghukaba mubili wake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Bo asyuka kubufwe, abamanyili bake bakakumbukila ukuti akayugha sisisi, sona bakasubila amasimbo na masyu gho u Yesu akayughagha.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu abamenye abandu mo babelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Bo u Yesu akali ali mu Yelusalemu pakabalilo ka pa lusekelo lwa Pasaka, abingi bakamusubila bo batesya ifiswigho fyo akabombagha. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Loli u Yesu atakasubila ukuti ikale nabo, pakuti akabamanya abandu bosi mo babelile, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />sona atakalondagha ukuti yumo asimikisye isya bandu, pakuti akasimanya mwene syo sili mumoyo wa mundu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu nu Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kukabako umundu yumo umu Falisayi, yo ilita lyake we Nikodemu, umulongosi wa Bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Akabuka kwa Yesu pa busiku nukumubusya ukuti, “Wee Labi, tusimenye ukuti uwe we mumanyisi yo afumite kwa Chala, pakuti ataliko umundu yo angabomba ifimanyisyo fyo uwe ukubomba, pala u Chala ate nawe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Naloli ngubabusya ukuti nayumo umundu yo angabutesya u Bunyafyale bwa Chala u kusita ukupapiwa sona.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />U Nikodemu akamulalusya akati, “Imba umundu usongo angapapiwa buli sona? Angingila sona mukati mulufukwe lwa ng’ina nukupapiwa ulwa bubili?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Naloli ngukubusya ukuti, nayumo umundu yo angingila mu Bunyafyale bwa Chala, ukusita kupapiwa sona kumisi na kwa Mbepo. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Cho chipapiwe ku mubili gho mubili, nacho chipapiwe mwa Mbepo we Mbepo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Utakaswighaghe chifukwa ngukubusya ukuti ubaghile pakupapiwa sona. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Imbepo yikukuka kosi ko yikulonda, ukwifwa bubu ichongo chake, loli utangamanya ko yikufuma pamo ko yikubuka. Momo sibelile na wesi yo apapiwa mwa Mbepo.<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />“U Nikodemu akalalusya akati, “Imba chingaba buli sisisi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Uwe we mumanyisi mu Isilayeli, imba utasimenye sisisi?<verse eid="JHN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Naloli ngukubusya ukuti, uswe tukuyugha syo tusimenye, tukusimikisya syo twasibona, loli nayumo yo akupokela ukusimikisya kwitu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Pala mutakusubila ifindu fya mu chisu chapasi ichi fyo ngubabusya, po mungasubila buli pala ngubabusya ifindu fya kumwanya? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Nayumo umundu yo afikitepo kumwanya, loli mwene u Mwana wa Mundu yo akafuma kumwanya.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ngati mo u Mozesi akinulila injoka mungolongo mula, wepe u Mwana wa Mundu abaghile ukwinuliwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ukuti wesi yo akusubila abe nu bumi bwa bwile na bwile. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Pakuti u Chala akachighana ngani ichisu chapasi, leka akachipa u Mwana wake mwene, ukuti wesi yo akusubila atakafwe loli abe nu bumi bwa bwile na bwile. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Pakuti u Chala atakatuma u Mwana wake muchisu cha pasi ukuti achilonge ichisu, loli ukuti ichisu ichapasi chipokiwe nawe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Wesi yo akumusubila u mwana atakulongiwa, loli yo atakumusubila alongiwe kale, chifukwa atasubile u ilita lya Mwana mwene uwa Chala. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ubu bo bulongi ubwa kuti, ubwelu bwisile muchisu ichapasi, loli abandu bachighanite ngani ichisi ukukinda ubwelu, pakuti imbombo syabo sikaba mbibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Pakuti wesi yo akubomba ifibibi abenganite nubwelu, po atangisa pa bwelu pakuti akoghopa ukuti imbombo syo akubomba singaboneka pa bwelu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Loli wesi yo akubomba ubwanaloli akubonekela pabwelu, sona isya kubombiwa syake sikumanyikwa ukuti abomba umwakumwifwila u Chala.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu nu Yohani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Panyuma pasisi, u Yesu na bamanyili bake bakabuka ku buyo bwa mu Yudeya, ko akikalako nabo akabalilo akapala bubu nu kosya abandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />U Yohani wepe akosyagha mu Enoni papipi nu Salimu, pakuti pakabapo amisi amingi ngani pala pala. Abandu bakabukagha kukwake, po akabosyagha. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Isi sikabombiwa bo nu Yohani atabikiwe mujela.)<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Abamanyili bamo aba Yohani bakanda pakususannya numu Yuda Yumo pa muteto wa kwiswepesya. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bakabuka kwa Yohani nu kuyugha ukuti, “We Labi, umundu yo ukaba nawe kwisila ilingi ilya lusoko lwa Yolodani, yo ukusimikisya nisyake, wepe akosya, sona abandu bosi bakubuka ku kwake.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />U Yohani akabamula akati, “Ataliko nayumo umundu yo angapokela chimo, pala atapeghiwe ukufuma kumwanya. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Umwe mwe mukusimikisya ukuti, une ngayugha ngati, ‘Une tene Kilisitu, loli ngatumiwa bubu mundasi mu mwake.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />U mukolo yo akusenyiwa weyo mwenecho wa mwanalume, loli usindisi wa mwene nyegha weyo akwimilila papipi nukuteghelesya, akuhoboka ngani bo akwifwa amasyu gha mwene nyegha, pakuti ulusekelo lwangu lula lwakwanilisiwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Umwene abaghile abe wa pamwanya, loli une mbaghile pakuba wapasi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yo akufuma kumwanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yo akufuma kumwanya, yo wapamwanya ukukinda bosi. Yo akufuma muchisu chapasi wa muchisu, sona akuyugha ngati wa muchisu chapasi, loli yo akufuma kumwanya weyo wapamwanya ukukinda bosi. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Umwene akusimikisya syo akusitesya nu kwifwa, loli nayumo yo akulupokela ulusimikisyo lwake. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Yo akulupokela ulusumikisyo lwake, akusimikisya ukuti u Chala wabwanaloli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Pakuti u Chala yo amutumite akuyugha amasyu gha Chala, pakuti u Chala akumupa u Mbepo ukusita ukumamilisya. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />U wise amughanite u Mwana sona abikite ifindu fyosi munyobe syake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Po wesi yo akumusubila u Mwana ali nu bumi bwa bwile na bwile, sona wesi yo atakumusubila u Mwana atakwisa pakubutesya ubumi, loli ubukalale bwa Chala bukwisa pa pake.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu nu Mukolo umu Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Bo u Malafyale asimanya ukuti aba Falisayi bifwile ukuti u Yesu akukaba nu kubosya a bamanyili abingi ukupoka u Yohani, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(napo u Yesu atakosyagha mwene, loli abamanyili bake.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Akafumamo mu buyo bwa Yudeya nukunyokela sona mu chigaba cha Galileya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />po akabaghila ukupulusannya mu Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Po akafika mukaya ka Samaliya, ilita lyake Sikali, papipi nu mughunda, gho u Yakobo akamupa u mwana wake u Jozefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ichisiba cha Yakobo chikaba mula mula, po u Yesu akalita ngani nu bulendo bwake, akakila pa chisiba pala. Kakaba kabalilo bo isuba lili pa mutu. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Kula kula akisa u mukolo uwa mu Samaliya pa kusemba amisi. Po u Yesu akamubusya akati, “Ndete ghamo amisi agha kung’wa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Pakuti abamanyili bake bakabuka mukaya akakulu pakughula ifya kulya.) <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Umukolo yula akamwamula akati, “Uwe we mu Yuda, une ne mu Samaliya. Po ukusuma buli buli amisi agha kung’wa?” (Pakuti aba Yuda na ba Samaliya batakwangalilana.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Pala wa fimenye ifyabupi fya Chala nu mundu yo akusuma amisi agha kung’wa, ngali umusumite, po ngali umwene akupile amisi agha bumi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Umukolo yula akati, “We Malafyale, ichakusembela ute nacho, sona ichisiba chibilite. Imba ungaghagha kwighi amisi agha bumi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Imba uwe we songo ukumupota u tata u Yakobo, yo akatupa ichisiba chichi cho akang’wa mwene, sona wepe na bana bake ni fitekiwa fyake akung’wa papapa? <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Umundu wesi yo akung’wa amisi agha akwisa pakuba ni nyota sona, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />loli wesi yo akung’wa amisi gho ngwisa pa kumupa atakwisa pakuba lumo ni nyota. Amisi gho ngwisa pakumupa gha kwisa ukuba mumwake ngati yo mbwibwi ya misi nu kumupa ubumi bwa bwile na bwile. <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Umukolo yula akayugha ku kwake akati, “We Mumanyisi, ndeteko amisi ghaghagha ukuti ndakise numilwepo lumo, pamo ukusemba amisi pano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />U Yesu akamubusya umukolo yula ukuti, “Bukagha umwitisye umulume wako mwise nawe kuno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Umukolo yula akamwamula akati, “Nde nawe umwanalume.” U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Wayugha ubwanaloli ukuti ute nu mwanalume, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />pakuti ukasenyiwa na banalume fayivi, sona umwanalume yo uli nawe pakabalilo aka te mulume wako. Wambusya ubwanaloli.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Umukolo yula akayugha ku kwake akati, “We Malafyale, nasyaghannya ukuti we musololi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Abanyenya bitu bakiputagha u Chala pighamba lilili, loli mwe ba Yuda mukuti mu Yelusalemu bo buyo bo abandu babaghile pakumwiputilapo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />U Yesu akumubusya umukolo yula akati, “We mukolo, subila une akabalilo ka kwisa ko mutakwisa pakumwiputa u Tata pighamba lilili, pamo mu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Umwe mwe ba Samaliya mutamumenye yo mukumwiputa, loli twe ba Yuda tumumenye yo tukumwiputa, pakuti ubupoki bukufumila mu ba Yuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Loli akabalilo kakwisa, sona kisile kale pakuti bo bakwiputa mubwanaloli bakwisa pakwiputa u Tata mwa mbepo nu bwanaloli, pakuti u Tata akubalonda bababa bo bakumwiputa. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />U Chala we Mbepo, po bosi bo bakumwiputa, bamwipute mwa mbepo na mu bwanaloli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Umukolo yula akayugha akati, “Simenye ukuti u Mesiya ayukwisa (yo we Kilisitu), bo isa, ayukutubusya fyosi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Une ne ngukuyugha nuwe, nene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Akabalilo kala kala abamanyili ba Yesu bakisa, bakaswigha ngani bo bamwagha akuyugha nu mukolo. Loli nayumo umundu yo akayugha nawe ukuti, “Imba ukulonda choni?” Pamo ukumulalusya ukuti, “Imba choni cho ukuyugha nawe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Umukolo yula akayileka isonda yake, akanyokela mukaya nu kuyugha na bandu ukuti, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Sa kuno mutesye umundu yo ambusya fyosi fyo ngabombagha. Imba atangaba we Kilisitu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Po bakafumamo mukaya mula nukubuka kwa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Pakabalilo kakako abamanyili bake bakamusuma u Yesu bakati, “We mumanyisi, lyangapo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Loli u Yesu akabamula akati, “Indi nacho ichakulya cho mutachimenye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Po abamanyili bake bakanda pakulalusannya bene bene ukuti, “Imba alipo yumo yo amwisile ni chakulya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Ichakulya changu ko kubomba u bwighane bwa yo andumite nu kumalisya imbombo yo akamba. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Imba mutakuyugha ukuti, ‘Kwasyala imyesi folo ukuti akabalilo kakwinulila ka kwane’? Loli ngubabusya ighula amaso tesya mumighunda, ifi byaliwa fyela, sona akabalilo akakwinulila kafika. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Yo akwinula akupokela amalipilo ghake, sona akubungannya iseke nukubuka nasyo ku bumi bwa bwile na bwile, ukuti yo akubyala nayo akwinula basekelele poka. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Syo abandu bakuyugha sya bwanaloli ukuti, ‘Yumo akubyala, uyungi akwinula.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ngabatuma pakwinula mo mutakabombamo. Abandu abangi bobo bakabomba imbombo ingafu, loli umwe mwakabilapo bubu pa mbombo yabo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Aba Samaliya abingi mukaya kala bakamusubila u Yesu chifukwa cha lisyu lyo umukolo yula akayughagha ukuti, “Ambusya fyosi fyo na bombagha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Bo aba Samaliya bisa kukwake bakamusuma ukuti ikale nabo, po u Yesu akikala kula kula amasiku mabili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Abingi ngani bakamusubila chifukwa cha masyu ghake, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />po bakamubusya umukolo yula bakati, “Tutakumusubila chifukwa cha fyo utubusisye, loli chifukwa chakuti twiyifwila twebene ku kwake, sona tumenye ukuti uyu mupoki wa chisu ichapasi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akumuposya u mwana umwanalume wa likambala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Bo ghakindapo amasiku mabili, u Yesu akabuka mukaya ka Galileya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Pakuti u Yesu umwenecho akati, “Umusololi atakughindikiwa lumo mukaya kake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Bo afika mu Galileya, abandu ba mula mula bakamupokela pakuti bakafitesya fyosi fyo akabomba mu Yelusalemu pa Lusekelo lwa Pasaka pakuti bope bakabapo pa lusekelo lula lula.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Po akanyokela sona mu Kana muchigaba cha ku Galileya, ko akaghasinda amisi pakuba bwalwa bwa mafilu. Ikambala limo likamutesya lyo umwana wake akabinagha mukaya ka Kapelinamu likaba pala pala. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Bo ifwa pakuti u Yesu isile mu Galileya ukufuma ku Yudeya, akabuka ku kwake nukumusuma ukuti abuke nawe mu Kapelinamu ukuti amuposye umwana wake yo akaba papipi pa kufwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />U Yesu akayugha nawe akati, “Nayumo umundu mumwinyu yo akwisa pakusubila pene po mwatesya ifi manyisyo ni fiswigho.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ikambala likamwamula likati, “We Malafyale, twende twebosi bo nu mwana wangu atafwile.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Bukagha, umwana wako umwanalume akwisa pakuba nu bumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Umundu yula akasubila syo u Yesu akayugha nukubuka. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Bo ali musila akubwela akakomana na bambombo bake nukubabusya ukuti, “Umwana wako umwanalume ali nu bumi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Akabalalusya akabalilo ko umwana wake akapolela. Bakamwamula bakati, “Isekema yikamulekela mumasuba na kabalilo ka wanu koloko pamusanya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Po uwise akakumbuka ukuti kakaba kabalilo ko u Yesu akamubusya ukuti, “Umwana wako umwanalume akwisa pakuba nu bumi.” Po yuyo na bosi abamunyumba yake bakasubila.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ichi chikaba chiswigho cha bubili cho u Yesu akabomba bo afuma mu Yudeya nu kufika mu Galileya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akumuposya umundu pa chisiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Panyuma pa isi, u Yesu akabuka mu Yelusalemu, chifukwa kukaba ulusekelo lwa Chiyuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Mu Yelusalemu papipi nu mulyango wa ng’osi, mukaba ichisiba, cho mu Chihebeli bakatingi Betisayida, chikasyunguliliwa utusyenga fayivi. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mo mukalambalala abandu abingi ngani ababine, abafwamaso, balemale na bachikwefu. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Po akabapo umundu yumo pala pala, yo akabina ifinja sate eyiti. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Bo u Yesu amutesya alambalile pala pala, po akamanya ukuti abina akabalilo akatali ngani, akamulalusya akati, “Imba ukulonda ukupola?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Umubine yula akamula akati, “We Malafyale, nde nu wakundwibika mu chisiba, po amisi ghakuyungana, pala nguti ndwibemo, ngwagha uyungi adwibitemo kale.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Po u Yesu akamubusya akati, “Nyamuka, nyamula ubulili bwako endagha.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Papapo na papapo umundu yula akapola, akanyamula ubulili bwake akanda pakwenda. Sisisi sikabombiwa pisiku lya kutusya, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />po abalongosi aba Chiyuda bakamubusya umundu yo akapola ukuti, “Ipano lisiku lya kutusya, indaghilo situ sitakutwitikisya ukuti unyamule ubulili bwako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Loli akamula akati, “Umundu yo akambosya une, akambusya akati, ‘Nyamula ubulili bwako endagha.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bakamulalusya bakati, “Mundu yuki yo akubusisye ukuti nyamula ubulili bwako endagha?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Loli umundu yo akapola atakamumanya yo akamuposya, chifukwa u Yesu akaleghannyapo pakuti pabuyo bula pakaba ichilundilo cha bandu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Panyuma pake u Yesu akamwagha mu nyumba ya Chala, nukumubusya ukuti, “Tesya, wapola utakabombe sona imbibi, ukuti ichibibi chingakuwila uwe.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Umundu yula akabuka nukubabusya abalongosi ba Chiyuda, ukuti we Yesu yo akamuposya. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Po pachifukwa ichi abalongosi aba Yuda bakanda pakumufwima u Yesu, pakuti akabomba imbombo pisiku lya kutusya. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “U Tata wangu akubomba imbombo akabalilo kosi, po nune bubu ngubomba.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Pachifukwa ichi, bakalondagha ngani pakumughogha u Yesu, chitakaba chifukwa chene chakuti akananga ululaghilo ulwa lisiku lya kutusya, loli chifukwa cha kuyugha ukuti u Chala we Tata, po akwipela mwene ukuti bayane nu Chala.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubulaghili bwa Mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Naloli ngubabusya umwe ukuti u Mwana atangabomba nachimo pamwene, loli syene syo asitesya u Wise akubomba, pakuti syo u Wise akubomba syo syo wepe u Mwana akubomba. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Pakuti u Wise amughanite u Mwana nukumulangisya fyosi fyo akubomba umwene. Po akwisa pa kumulangisya imbombo ingulu ngani ukukila pa isi, ukuti mukwisa pakuswigha. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Pakuti ngati mo u Wise akususikisya abafwe nukubapa ubumi, momo wepe nu Mwana akupa ubumi kubo akulonda. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />U Wise atakumulonga nayumo umundu, loli amupile ubulaghili bosi ubwa kulongela u Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />nukuti bosi ba mughindike u Mwana ngati mo ba mughindikile u Wise. Umundu wesi yo atakumughindika u Mwana, atakughindika nu Wise bubu, yo akamutuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Naloli ngubabusya umwe, ukuti bosi bo bakwifwa amasyu ghangu nukumusubila yo akanduma, bali nu bumi bwa bwile na bwile. Batakwisa pakulongiwa, loli balobokako kubufwe nukwingila mu bumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Naloli une ngubabusya umwe, akabalilo kakwisa sona kisile kale, ko abafwe bakwisa pakwifwa isyu lya Mwana wa Chala, po bosi bo bakwifwa bakwisa pakuba nu bumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Pakuti ngati mo u Wise ali nu bumi pa mwene, momo akumupela u Mwana wake ukuba nu bumi bwake mwene, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />sona amupile ubulaghili bwa kulongela pakuti Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mutakaswighaghe pa isi, pakuti akabalilo ka kwisa ko bosi abamumapumba bakwisa pakwifwa isyu lyake, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nukufumamo, po bosi bo bakabombagha inyisa bakwisa pakusyuka kubufwe nukuba nu bumi, loli bosi bo bakabomba imbibi bakwisa pakusyuka kubufwe nukulongiwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abakusimikisya isya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Ndangabombapo nachimo pa nemwene. Ngulonga bubu namo une nifwila, po ubulongi bwangu bwanaloli pakuti ndakubomba ubwighane bwangu, loli ubwighane bwa yo akanduma une.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Pala ngwisimikisya ne mwene, ulusimikisyo lwangu te lwa naloli. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Loli pali yumo yo akusimikisya nisyangu, po ngumanya ukuti syo akusimikisya sya bwanaloli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Umwe mukatuma indumi kwa Yohani, po asimikisya ubwanaloli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Po une ndakupokela ulusimikisyo lwa mundu, loli ngubabusya sisisi ukuti mupokiwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />U Yohani akaba ngati nyale, yo yikakagha nu kubala, sona umwe mukalonda ukuhoboka pakabalilo akapala nu bwelu bwake. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Loli une indi nu lusimikisyo ulukulu ngani ukupota u lwa Yohani. Pakuti imbombo syo u Tata wangu akamba malisye, imbombo syo timbombe tisinyimile ubumboni ukuti Utata andumite une. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Sona u Tata yo akanduma weyo akasimikisya isya une. Umwe mwe mutifwilepo lumo isyu lyake, pamo ukutesya kope mutamutesisyepo lumo akabonekele kake, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />lyope nisyu lyake litalimo mumwinyu pakuti mutakumusubila yo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ukubusikisya amasimbo pakuti mukwinong’ona ukuti momo mukwisa pakubwaghamo ubumi bwa bwile na bwile, agha gho masimbo gho ghakusimikisya isya une, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />loli umwe mukukana ukwisa kukwangu ukuti mube nu bumi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ndakulonda amapalo gha bandu, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />loli mbamenye mo mubelile, sona simenye ukuti mutamughanite u Chala mumyoyo yinyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Une nisile mwilita lya Tata wangu, loli umwe mutambokelite une, pala yumo akwisila mu bulaghili bwake mwene, umwe mukwisa pakumupokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Imba mungasubila buli buli pala mukupokela amapalo mwebene bene, sona mutakwiyula pakulonda amapalo gho ghakufuma kwa Chala mwene? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mutakinong’onaghe ukuti une ngwisa pakubapa inongwa kwa Tata, awe. U Mozesi yo mukumusubila, weyo akwisa pakubapa umwe inongwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Pala mu kamusubila u Mozesi, po musubile une pakuti umwene akasimba nisya une. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Loli pala mutakusisubila syo akasimba, imba mungasubila buli buli syo nguyugha?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akubalisya abandu fayivi sabuzani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayi14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Panyuma pake u Yesu akaloboka pakubuka kwisila inine ilya nyanja ya Galileya (yo yikaba nyanja ya Tibeliyasi.) <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Po ichilundilo ichikulu icha bandu chikamukonga, pakuti bakatesya ifiswigho fyo akabombagha pa babine. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Po u Yesu akakwela pighamba nu kwikala pasi na bamanyili bake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Akabalilo ka pa Lusekelo lwa Pasaka ulwa ba Yuda kakaba papipi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Bo u Yesu akelengannya akachitesya ichilundilo ichikulu icha bandu chikwisa ku kwake, po akayugha kwa Filipu akati, “Imba tungaghula kwighi ichakulya icha kubalisya abandu bosi aba?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Akayugha ichi akamughela bubu u Filipu pakuti akamanya nganila isyakubomba.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />U Filipu akamwamula akati, “Napo amalipilo gho ghangalipila ukukila pakati pa chinja ghatangaghula ichakulya icha kukwana ukuti umundu wesi alyepo papala.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Weka uwa bamanyili bake, u Andeleya uwamwabo wa Simoni Pitala akayugha nawe akati, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Alipo yumo umulumyana pano, yo ali ni fibama fayivi ifya bufu bwa malesi nu tuswi tubili. Imba ifi fingakwana abandu bosi bababa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Mubabusye abandu bikale pasi.” (Pala pala pakaba isote ilingi) Po abandu bosi bakikala pasi. Abanalume bakabapo fiyivi sabuzani. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />U Yesu akasenya ifibama akamupalisya u Chala nukubagabannya abandu bo bakikala pasi pala pala, akasenya sona bububu niswi sila, po bosi bakalya ukuyana namo bakalondelagha. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bo balya bikuta, u Yesu akababusya abamanyili bake akati, “Bunganika utubulubusya ukuti katakabepo nakamo akakutaghiwa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Po bakabunganika utubulubusya tosi, bakisusya ifitundu twelovu nu tubulubusya twa fibama fayivi ifya bufu bwa balale, fyosi fyo fikasyala bo abandu balya.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Bo abandu batesya ichiswigho cho u Yesu akabomba, bakati, “Naloli musololi yula, yo akwisa mu chisu chapasi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Bo u Yesu asyaghannya ukuti bakulonda pakumukakamisya, ukuti bamwimike pakuba we Malafyale, akafumapo sona nukubuka pakwikala mwene pighamba.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akwenda pamisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayi14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Bo Kwanda pa kwila, abamanyili ba Yesu bakikagha ukubuka ku nyanja, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />nukukwela mubwato. Bakanda pakuloboka inyanja nukubuka mu Kapelenamu. Ipano kwila kale, loli u Yesu bo akali atafikite kukwabo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Amayigha ghakanda pakukoma panyanja chifukwa cha kukuka kwa mbepo iya maka. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bo benda ubutali bwa ma kilomita fiyivi pamo sikisi bakamutesya u Yesu akwenda pamisi akapalamila ku bwato, po ubogha bukabakola ngani. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Loli u Yesu akababusya akati, “Mutakoghopaghe! Nene.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Po bakahoboka nukumukwesya mubwato, sona papapo na papapo ubwato bukafika pabwima po bakabukagha.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu bakumulonda u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ilya ningelo lyake ichilundilo cha bandu cho chikasyalikila kwisila inine ilya nyanja chikasyaghannya ukuti bukabapo ubwato boka pabuyo bula, sona u Yesu atakakwela nabamanyili bake, loli ukuti bakenda bene <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />amabwato aghangi gho ghakafumila mu Tebeliya, ghakafika papipi nubuyo bo abandu bakalilaghapo ifibama bo u Malafyale afisaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Bo ichilundilo cha bandu chikatesya ukuti u Yesu pamo abamanyili bake bosi batalipo, chikakwela mu bwato nukubuka mu Kapelinamu pakumulonda u Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu chibama icha bumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bo abandu bakamwagha u Yesu kwisila ilingi ilya nyanja, bakamulalusya bakati, “We Labi, imba ukisa lighi kuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Naloli ngubabusya ukuti umwe mutakandonda chifukwa chakuti mukatesya ifiswigho, loli chifukwa chakuti mukalya ifibama nukwikuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mutakabombaghe imbombo ukuti mube ni chakulya cho chinganangika, loli bombela ichakulya cho chingakupa ubumi bwa bwile na bwile. Ichi chakulya cho u Mwana wa Mundu akwisa pakubapa pakuti u Chala u Wise weyo abikitepo papake ichimanyilo icha kusimikisya.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Po bakamulalusya bakati, “Imba tubaghile tubombe choni ukuti tubombe imbombo ya Chala yo akulonda?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Imbombo ya Chala yo iyi, ukuti mumusubilaghe yo akamutuma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bakamulalusya sona bakati, “Imba chiswigho chiki cho ungabomba ukuti tuchitesye nukukusubila? Imba akwisa pakubomba choni? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Abanyenya bitu bakalyanga ichakulya bakachitisyagha ukuti mana mungolongo mula ukuyana na Masimbo aghakuti, ‘Akabapa ifibama fya kumwanya ukuti balye.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />U Yesu akayugha nabo akati, “Naloli ngubabusya ukuti atakaba we Mozesi yo akabapa ichibama icha ichakufuma kumwanya awe, Loli we Tata wangu yo akabapa ichibama icha bwanaloli ukufuma kumwanya.” <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Pakuti ichibama cho u Chala akupa chocho chikwika ukufuma kumwanya nukuchipa ichisu chapasi ubumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bakayugha nawe bakati, “Malafyale, utupe bwile ichibama chichichi”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Une ne chibama ichipela bumi.” Umundu wesi yo akwisa kukwangu atakubapo lumo lumo nisala, sona umundu wesi yo akusubila une atakwisa ukuba lumo ni nyota. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Loli ngababusya ukuti napo mwandesya, pope mukali mutakusubila. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Bosi bo u Tata wangu akumba une bakwisa ku kwangu, sona bosi bo bakwisa ku kwangu. Ndakwisa pa kubatagha panja, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />pakuti ndikite ukufuma kumwanya pakubomba ubwighane bwangu, loli nisile pakubomba ubwighane bwa yo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Po ubwighane bwa yo akanduma bwakuti ndakataghepo nayumo mu bandu bo ambile, loli mbasusye bosi pisiku ilya bumalilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Pakuti ubu bobo bwighane bwa Tata wangu akulonda ukuti, wesi yo akumutesya u Mwana nukusubila mu mwake, abe nu bumi bwa bwile na bwile. Po une ngwisa pakumususya pisiku lyabumalilo.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Po aba Yuda bakanda pakwilumbusya chifukwa u Yesu akati, “Une ne chibama cho chikika ukufuma kumwanya.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Po bakati, “Imba uyu te we Yesu u Mwana wa Jozefu, yo uwise nu ng’ina tubamenye? Imba akuyugha buli buli ukuti akika akufuma kumwanya?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Mutakilumbusyaghe mwebene bene. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Atalipo umundu nayumo yo angisa ku kwangu pene po u Tata wangu yo akanduma, amughusila ku kwangu, sona nune ngwisa pakumususya pisiku lyabumalilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Sisimbiwe nabasololi ukuti, ‘Bosi bakwisa pakumanyisiwa nu Chala.’ Wesi yo akwifwa syo u Chala akuyugha nukumanyila ku kwake, weyo akwisa kukwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Nayumo yo amutesisyepo u Tata, loli yo afumite kwa Chala, weyo amutesisyepo u Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Naloli ngubabusya umwe ukuti yo akusubila une ali nabo ubumi bwa bwile na bwile. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Une ne chibama cha bumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Abanyenya binyu bakalyanga amana mungolongo, loli bakafwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Loli ichi cho chibama cho chikwika ukufuma kumwanya ukuti umundu wesi yo akulya ichibama atakafwange. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Une ne chibama ichipela bumi cho chikika ukufuma kumwanya. Pala umundu wesi yo akulya ichibama chichichi, akwisa pakubangako bwile na bwile. Ichibama cho ngwisa pakupa gho mubili wangu, ukuti ichisu chapasi chibe nu bumi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Po abalongosi aba Yuda bakanda pakudalingana bene bene. “Imba umundu yuyuyu akutupa buli buli umubili wake ukuti tulye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />U Yesu akayugha nabo akati, “Naloli ngubabusya ukuti pala mutakulya umubili wa Mwana wa Mundu, sona mutakung’wa ibanda lyake, mutakwisa pakuba nu bumi mumwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Umundu wesi yo akulya umubili wangu nu kung’wa ibanda lyangu, yo ali nubumi bwa bwile na bwile, po une ngwisa ukumususya pisiku lyabumalilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Pakuti umubili wangu cho chakulya chanaloli, sona ibanda lyangu cho chakung’wa chanaloli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Umundu wesi yo akulya umubili wangu nukung’wa ibanda lyangu, akwikala mumwangu, po une ngwikala mumwake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ngati mo u Tata umumi akandumila, po une indi nubumi chifukwa cha Tata, po umundu wesi yo akundya, akwisa pakuba nu bumi chifukwa cha une. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ichi cho chibama cho chikika ukufuma kumwanya. Chitayanite ni chibama cho abanyenya binyu bakalya nukufwa panyuma pake. Loli bosi bo bakulya ichibama ichi bakwisa pakubako bwile na bwile.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />U Yesu akayugha sisisi bo akumanyisya munyumba ya kwiputilamo mu Kapelenamu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu agha bumi bwa bwile na bwile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Abamanyili bake abingi bakifwa sisisi nukuti, “Ubumanyisi ubu bupala pala ngani. Imba we wenu yo angitikisya?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Loli u Yesu akamanya ukuti abamanyili bake bakwilumbusya pa sisisi, akayugha nabo akati, “Imba isi sikubafulasya umwe? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Po sikwisa pakuba buli buli bo mukutesya u Mwana wa Mundu akukwela ukubuka ko akabanga pabwandilo? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />U mbepo mwene weyo akutupa ubumi, umubili gho ghute nimbombo nayimo. Amasyu gho mbabusisye ghogho ghakubapa u mbepo nu bumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Loli balipo bamo mumwinyu bo batakusubila.” (Pakuti u Yesu akasimanya nganila ukwandila ku bwandilo bo batakwisa pakusubila, sona na yo akwisa pakumubika munyobe sya balughu.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Po akati, “Ichi cho chifukwa ngubabusya ukuti nayumo umundu yo akwisa ku kwangu pene po u Tata amwitikisya.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ukufuma akabalilo kala, Abamanyili bake abingi bakanyokelela kunyuma nukuleka pakwenda sona nawe. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />U Yesu akabalalusya abamanyili bake twelovu bala akati, “Imba numwe bubu mukulonda pakubuka?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />U Simoni Pitala akamwamula akati, “We Malafyale, imba tungabuka kwa wenu? Uwe uli nagho amasyu amapela bumi agha bwile na bwile. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Po utwe tukusubila nukusyaghannya ukuti, uwe we mwikemo wa Chala.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Imba ndakabasala umwe twelovu? Loli weka mumwinyu mumyasi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Akayughagha u Yudasi, umwana wa Simoni Sikaliyoti. Pakuti u Yudasi akaba wa bamo mu bamanyili twelovu bala, akaba wa kumubika u Yesu munyobe sya balughu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu na ba wamwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Panyuma pa isi, u Yesu akendelagha mu Galileya. Atakalondagha ukwendanika mu chigaba cha Yudeya pakuti abalongosi ba Chiyuda bakalondagha pakumughogha. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Akabalilo ka Lusekelo lwa fisakasa ulwa Chiyuda lukaba papipi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />po aba wamwabo ba Yesu bakayugha nawe bakati, “Fumako kuno ubukaghe mu chigaba cha Yudeya, umwakuti bope bo bakukukonga batesye imbombo syako syo ukubomba. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Nayumo umundu yo akufifa cho akubomba, pala akulonda ukuti amanyikwe pabwelu. Pala akubomba ifindu ifi, ubaghile wilangisye wemwene kuchisu chosi ichapasi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />(Bope na ba wamwabo batakamusubila.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />U Yesu akayugha nabo akati, “Akabalilo kangu akisa katakwanite, loli ku kwinyu akabalilo kosi kisa bubu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Abandu aba mu chisu ichapasi batangababenga umwe, loli bambengite pakuti ngusimikisya ukuti imbombo syabo mbibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Umwe bukagha ku lusekelo. Une ndakubukako chifukwa chakuti akabalilo kangu akisa katakwanite.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Bo ababusya sisisi, akasyala mwene muchigaba cha mu Galileya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu pa Lusekelo lwa fisakasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Loli bo aba wamwabo babuka ku lusekelo kula, po wepe u Yesu akabuka. Atakabuka umwakubonekela, loli umwakubwama. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Abalongosi aba Chiyuda bakamulondagha pa lusekelo lula lula. Bakalalusya bakati, “Imba umwene angaba ali kwighi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kukabako ukuteketelana ukukulu ngani nisya Yesu muchilundilo mula mula. Abandu bamo batingi, “Mundu mwisa.” Abangi batighi, “Awe, akubasobesya bubu abandu” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Loli atakabako nayumo yo akamuyughagha pabwelu pakuti bakaboghopagha abalongosi ba Chiyuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Bo ulusekelo lwa fika pakati, u Yesu akingila mu Nyumba ya Chala nukwanda pakumanyisya. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Abalongosi ba Chiyuda bakaswigha ngani nukuti, “Imba umundu yuyuyu akafimanya buli buli ifindu fyosi fififi pakuti umwene atamanyile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Ifimanyisyo fyo ngubamanyisya te fyangu nu lwangu, loli fikuma kuyo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Umundu wesi yo akulonda pakubomba fyo u Chala akulonda, akwisa pakumanya pala fyo ngumanyisya fikufuma kwa Chala pamo nguyugha nu bulaghili ubwangu une nemwene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Umundu wesi yo akuyugha nu bulaghili bwake mwene, akwilondela mwene amapalo. Loli wesi yo akumulondela amapalo yo akanduma yo wabwanaloli, sona ubumyasi butalimo mumwake. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />U Mozesi akabapa indaghilo. Imba temomumo? Loli nayumo umundu mumwinyu yo akukonga indaghilo. Imba choni cho mukulonda pakungogha?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Po ichilundilo chikamula chikati, “Uli nimbepo imbibi! Imba we wenu yo akulonda pakukughogha? <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Ngabomba ichiswigho choka, po mwebosi mukaswigha. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />U Mozesi akalamula pakusilimula abana binyu abalumyana, (napo atakaba we Mozesi yo akandisya, loli abanyenya binyu), po umwe mukusilimula abana binyu abalumyana pisiku lya kutusya. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Pala umulumyana akusilimuliwa pisiku lya kutusya, ukuti indaghilo sya Mozesi sikaleke pakunanganika, imba mukungalalila chifukwa chakuti ngaposya umundu pisiku lya kutusya? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mutakalonganaghe pakutesya akabonekele ka mundu, loli mulongeleghe mubwanaloli.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imba u Yesu we Kilisitu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Abandu bamo aba mu Yelusalemu bakayugha bakati, “Imba uyu te weyo abalongosi ba Chiyuda bakulonda pakumughogha? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Tesya lelo akuyugha pabwelu, loli abene batakuyugha nachimo. Imba chingaba chakuti abalongosi basimenye ukuti we Kilisitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Loli twebosi tumenyeko ko u mundu uyu akafuma, bo u Kilisitu akwisa, nayumo umundu yo akwisa pakumanya ko akafuma.<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Bo u Yesu akumanyisya mu nyumba ya Chala, akayugha na masyu gha pamwanya akati, “Naloli mumenye, sona mumenyeko nako fumite. Une ndisile nu bulaghili ubwangu nemwene. Loli yo akanduma wabwanaloli umwe mutamumenye, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />loli une mumenye pakuti ngafuma ku kwake, sona weyo akanduma.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Po bakalondagha pakumukola, loli atakabapo nayumo uwakumupalamasya pakuti akabalilo kake kakaba katakwanite. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Loli abandu abingi mu chilundilo chila bakamusubila ukuti, “Bo u Kilisitu akwisa, imba akwisa pakubomba ifiswigho ukukila fyo umundu uyu akubomba?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abasilikali bakatumiwa pakumukola u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Aba Falisayi bakifwa syo ichilundilo cha bandu chikuteketelana nisya Yesu, po abene na balongisi ba baputi bakabatuma abasilikali bamo pakumukola. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />U Yesu akati, “Ngwisa pakuba numwe pakabalilo akapimba, po ngwisa pakubuka kwa yo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mukwisa pakundonda, loli mutakwisa pakunyagha pakuti ko ngubuka mutangafikako.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Abalongosi ba Chiyuda bakalalusannya bene bene bakati, “Imba akulonda ukubuka kwighi ko tutangamwagha? Imba akulonda pakubuka muchisu chaba Giliki cho abandu bitu bakwikala umwakunyambana, nu kubamanyisya aba Giliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Akayugha ukuti mukwisa pakundonda, loli mutakwisa pa kunyagha, ‘sona ko ngubuka, mutangafikako.’ Imba akung’anamula choni’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isoko sya misi agha bumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Isiku lya bumalilo ilya pamwanya ngani ilya lusekelo, u Yesu akimilila nukuyugha nisyu lya pamwanya ukuti, “Umundu wesi yo ali ni nyota ise kukwangu nukung’wa! <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti, “Umundu wesi yo akusubila une, isoko sya misi agha bumi sikwisa pakwendagha ukufuma mumwake.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />U Yesu akayughagha nisya Mbepo, yo abandu bo bakamusubila bakisa pakupokela. Pakabalilo kala kala u Mbepo akaba atapeghiwe pakuti u Yesu akaba akali pakupokela ubughindikiwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukugabikana pakati pa bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bo ichilundilo cha bandu bamo bifwa amasyu ghaghagha, chikayugha chikati, “Naloli umundu Musololi yula.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Abangi bakati, “Uyu we Kilisitu.” Loli abangi bakati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">“Umupoki yula atangafuma muchigaba cha Galileya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Amasimbo ghakuti u Kilisitu akwisa pakuba luko lwa Devedi nukuti akwisa pakupapiwa mu Betelehemu mukaya ko u Devedi akikalaghamo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Po ichilundilo cha bandu chikagabingana chifukwa cha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bamo bakalondagha pakumupalamasya, loli atakabapo nayumo umundu uwa kumupalamasya.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukusita kusubila kwa balongosi ba Chiyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Bo abalindilili ba nyumba ya Chala bala banyokela, abalongosi ba baputi na ba Falisayi bakabalalusya u Yesu bakati, “Imba choni cho mutisile nawe?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Abalindilili bakamula bakati, “Nayumo umundu yo ayughitepo ngati mundu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Aba Falisayi bakalalusya bakati, “Imba numwe abasimbwile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />“Imba alipo weka pakati pa balongosi pamo pakati pa ba Falisayi amusubile? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Loli ichilundilo cha bandu ichi cho chitasimenye Indaghilo sya Mozesi, chocho chighuniwe.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Yumo mu ba Falisayi bala akaba we Nikondemu, yo kale akabuka kwa Yesu. Akayugha nabo akati, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Imba indaghilo situ sikutwitikisya pakumulonga umundu, bo tutamwifwile akuyugha mwene cho abombite?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bakamwamula bakati, “Imba nuwe bubu ukufumila muchigaba cha mu Galileya? Londelesya mu Masimbo batesye, po bakwisa pakwagha ukuti nayumo umusololi yo angafuma muchigaba cha mu Galileya.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Umukolo yo akakoliwa mu bulowe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />U Yesu akanyokela kwi ghamba lya misyunguti. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Pangelo ngelo ngani akingila sona munyumba ya Chala, ko abandu bosi bakamubunganila, akikala pasi nukwanda pakubamanyisya. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Abamanyisi aba ndaghilo na ba Falisayi bakisa nu mukolo yo bakamukola mubulowe, bakamwimika pakati pa bandu bosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Po bakamubusya u Yesu bakati, “We Mumanyisi, umukolo uyu bamukola akubomba ubulowe. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Indaghilo sya Mozesi sikalamula ukuti abakolo baba baghoghiwaghe pakumusumba na mabwe. Losulu uwe ukuti choni?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bakayugha bububu ukuti bamuteghe mukayughile, umwakuti bamususye. Loli u Yesu akinama pasi akasimba na kafingwi kake. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Bo balindile bububu pakumulalusya, u Yesu akinuka nukubabusya ukuti, “Yo atanangitepo lumo, weyo andile pakumusumba nibwe umukolo uyu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Po akinama sona nukusimba pasi na kafingwi kake. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Loli bo bifwa sisisi, bakafumaghapo weka weka ukwandila abasongo, mupaka u Yesu akasyala mwene nu mukolo yula, bo akali imilile pala pala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />U Yesu akinuka nukumulalusya umukolo yula ukuti, “Imba bali kwighi bo bakukulonga? Atasyalitepo nayumo umundu uwakukulonga?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Umukolo yula akamula akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">“We Malafyale, nayumo umundu.” U Yesu akati, “Nune bububu ndakulonga, bukagha, utakabombe sona imbibi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu we bwelu bwa chisu cha pasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Bo u Yesu akuyugha sona na bandu akati, “Une ne bwelu bwa muchisu, po wesi yo akungonga une atakwisa pakwenda lumo muchisi, loli akwisa pakuba nu bwelu bwa bumi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Aba Falisayi bakayugha nawe bakati, “Uwe ukwisimikisya wemwene, ulusimikisyo lwako te lwa bwanaloli.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Napo ngwisimikisya nisya une nemwene, ulusimikisyo lwangu lwa bwanaloli pakuti menyeko ko ngafuma nako ngubuka, loli mutamenyeko ko ngafuma pamo ko ngubuka. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Umwe mukulonga ukufwana na kabonekele ka bandu, loli une ndakumulonga umundu nayumo. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Loli pala ngulonga ubulongi bwangu bwa bwanaloli, pakuti nde nemwene, loli indi poka nu Tata yo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Sisimbiwe mu Ndaghilo sinyu ukuti ubwa kamboni bwa bandu babili, ko kuti bwa bwanaloli. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Une ngwisimikisya nemwene nisya une, po wepe u Tata yo akanduma, akusimikisya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Po bakamulalusya bakati, “Ali ko kwighi ughuso?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">U Yesu akamula akati, “Une mutamenye, wepe nu Tata wangu mutamumenye. Pala mukamanyagha, ngali wepe u Tata wangu mumumenye.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />U Yesu akayugha amasyu ghosi ghaghagha bo akumanyisya mu Nyumba ya Chala, papipi nu buyo bwa kusopelamo ifyabupi. Loli atakabapo nayumo umundu uwa kumukola pakuti akabalilo kake kakaba kakali katakwanite.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwe mutangabukako ko ngubuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />U Yesu akababusya sona akati, “Une ngubuka, po mukwisa pakundonda, loli mukwisa pakufwila mumbibi sinyu. Mutangabukako ko ngubuka.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Po abalongosi aba Chiyuda bakayugha bakati, imba akwisa pakwighogha mwene, po akuyugha akuti, ko ngubuka une, umwe mutabaghile pakufikako?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Umwe mwe mukafuma muchisu chapasi ichi, une ngafuma kumwanya. Umwe mwe bandu ba muchisu cha pasi ichi, loli une tene wa muchisu chapasi ichi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ichi cho chifukwa ngababusya ukuti mukwisa pakufwila mumbibi sinyu, pala mutakusubila ukuti, ‘Une nene.’”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bakamulalusya bakati, “Imba we wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">U Yesu akabamula akati, “Une ne mundu yo ababusya ukwandila kubwandilo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Indi nasyo nyingi isya kuyugha nukubasusya umwe. Loli yo akanduma wabwanaloli, po nguchibusya ichisu cha pasi syene syo nifwile ku kwake.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Batakasyaghannya ukuti u Yesu akayughagha ku kwabo nisya wise. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />U Yesu akayugha nabo akati, “Bo mukumukwesya u Mwana wa Mundu, po mukwisa pakumanya ukuti, ‘Une nene’ sona mukwisa pakumanya ukuti ndakubombapo nachimo nu bulaghili bwangu, loli nguyugha syene syo u Tata ambusisye ukuti njughe. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Po yo akanduma ali poka nune, atandekite nemwene pakuti akabalilo kosi ngubomba syo sikumuhobosya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Bo u Yesu ayugha sisisi, abingi bakamusubila.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubwanaloli bukwisa pakubasatula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Po u Yesu akababusya aba Yuda bo bakamusubila akati, “Pala mukwifwila amasyu ghangu, naloli mwe bamanyili bangu, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />umwe mukwisa pakubumanya ubwanaloli, sona ubwanaloli bukwisa pakubasatula.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bakamwamula bakati, “Utwe twe baluko lwa Abulahamu, tute lumo basya ba Mundu yumo. Po ukung’anamula choni pakuyugha ukuti mukwisa pakuba basatuke?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Bwanaloli ngubabusya ukuti umundu wesi yo akubomba imbibi, musya wa mbibi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Umusya atakwikalisya munyumba akabalilo kosi, loli umwana umwanalume yo akwikalisya akabalilo kosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Pala u Mwana wa Mundu akubasatula, po naloli mukwisa pakuba mwe basatuke. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Simenye ukuti mwe baluko lwa Abulahamu, loli mukulonda pakungogha, pakuti isyu lyangu litalimo mu mwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Une nguyugha syo nasitesya kwa Tata wangu, loli umwe mukubomba syo mukifwa kwa tata winyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Abene bakamwamula bakati, “Utwe utata we Abulahamu.” U Yesu akabamula akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">“Pala mukaba bana ba Abulahamu ngali mukubomba imbombo syo Abulahamu akabombagha. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Loli umwe mukulonda pakungogha, umundu yo ababusisye ubwanaloli, bo ngifwa pakufuma kwa Chala. U Abulahamu atakabomba ngati sisisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Umwe mukubomba imbombo sya tata winyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Abene bakamwamula bakati, “Utwe tutakapapiwa mubulowe, tuli nu tata weka, yo we Chala.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Pala u Chala akabanga we tata winyu, ngali munganite une, pakuti nisa kuno ukufumila kwa Chala, pakuti ndakisa nemwene, loli weyo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Imba choni cho mutakusyaghannya syo nguyugha? Chifukwa mutangifwisya isyu lyo nguyugha. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Umwe u tata winyu, Mumyasi yula, po mukulonda ifinyenwa fya tata winyu, ukwandila ko ku bwandilo umwene akaba mughoghi, sona atimilile lumo pa bwanaloli pakuti ubwanaloli butalimo mumwake, bo umwene akuyugha ubumyasi bwene, po akuyugha isyake mwene, pakuti umwene mumyasi, sona weyo we tata wa bumyasi bosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Loli pakuti nguyugha ubwanaloli, mutakusubila. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Imba alimo yumo mumwinyu yo angasimikisya ukuti une ne wambibi? Pala nguyugha ubwanaloli, po imba choni cho mutakusubila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yo ali mwa Chala, akwifwa amasyu gha Chala. Loli umwe mutakwifwa chifukwa mute mwa Chala.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu nu Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Aba Yuda bakamulalusya u Yesu bakati, “Imba tutakayugha ubwanaloli ukuti we Musamaliya, sona uli nimbepo imbibi?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Une nde nimbepo imbibi, loli ngumughindika u Tata, loli umwe mutakungindika une. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Une ndakwilondela nemwene amapalo, loli aliko weka yo akulonda, sona weyo mulongi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Naloli ngubabusya ukuti, pala wesi yo akwifwila amasyu ghangu, atakwisa pakufwa lumo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Aba Yuda bakamubusya bakati, “Ipano twasimikisya ukuti uli nimbepo imbibi. U Abulahamu akafwa, bope na basololi bakafwa, loli uwe ukuyugha ukuti umundu wesi yo akughifwila amasyu ghangu atakwisa pakufwa lumo. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Imba uwe we songo ngani ukukila u tata witu u Abulahamu, yo akafwa? Sona bope na basololi bakafwa, imba ukwinong’ona ukuti we wenu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Pala ngighindika nemwene ngali ulughindiko lwangu lwa bubu. We Tata yo akungindika, yo umwe mukuti we Chala winyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Umwe mutamumenyepo lumo, loli une mumenye. Pala nguti ndamumenye, ngali ne mumyasi ngati mwemwe, loli une mumenye, sona ngwifwila amasyu ghake. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />U tata winyu u Abulahamu akahoboka ngani bo akutesya ukwisa kwa lisiku lyangu, po akatesya nu kuhoboka ngani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Aba Yuda bakamubusya u Yesu bakati, “We utafikite ni finja fifite, loli ukuti ukamutesya u Abulahamu!” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Naloli ngubabusya une ukuti ngabako kale bo nu Abulahamu akali pakupapiwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Po bakaseba amabwe ukuti bamusumbe nagho, loli u Yesu akabwama nu kufumamo mu nyumba ya Chala.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akamuposya u mwanalume yo akapapiwa mufwamaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Bo akupulusannya, akamutesya umundu yo akaba mufwamaso ukufuma mo akapapiliwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Abamanyili bake bakamulalusya bakati, “Mumanyisi, imba we wenu yo akananga, umundu uyu pamo bapapi bake, ukuti apapiwe mufwamaso?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Atakaba weyuyo, pamo bapapi bake bo bakananga. Loli ichi chikabombiwa ukuti imbombo sya Chala sibonekelemo mumwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Bo kukali kwelu tubaghile pakubomba imbombo ya yo akanduma. Ubusiku bukwisa bo nayumo umundu angabomba imbombo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Pakwikala une muchisu chapasi, ne bwelu bwa muchisu chapasi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Bo ayugha sisisi, u Yesu akafwina amati pasi, akakandannya ilongwi na mati ghala, po akamupaka umundu yula ni longwi mumaso, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />akayugha ku kwake akati, “Bukagha uye usukusule muchisiba cha Silowamu.” (Cho chikung’anamula ukuti ukutumiwa). Po akabuka nukuya pakusukusula kumaso, po akanyokela bo akutesya.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Abapalamani bake na bandu bo bakamutesyagha bwile bo akusuma suma bakalalusya bakati, “Imba te weyo akikalagha akasuma sumagha?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamo bakayugha ukuti, “We yuyo.” Bamo bakati, “Awe, Bakolanite bubu nawe.” Loli umwene akababusya akati, “Nene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bakayugha ku kwake bakati, “Imba amaso ghako ghakutesya buli buli?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Umwene akamula akati, “Umunndu yo bakuti Yesu, akakanda ilongwi nukumbaka ku maso, akambusya akati, ‘Bukagha kasukusule kumaso muchisiba cha Silowamu. Po ngabuka nukusukusula kumaso, po ghakanda pakutesya.’”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Po bakati ku kwake, “Imba ali ko kwighi umundu yuyuyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Akayugha akati, “Ndamenyeko.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aba Falisayi bakulondelesya isya kuposiwa kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Abandu bakamubika ku Bafalisayi umundu yo kale akaba mufwamaso, <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />chifukwa likaba lisiku lya kutusya lyo u Yesu akakandannya ilongwi nukuposya umundu yula. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Abafalisayi bakamulalusya sona namo amaso ghake ghakighukila. Po umwene akababusya akati, “Akambaka ilongwi mumaso ghangu, po ngasukusula kumaso, po ipano ngutesya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bamo Abafalisayi bakayugha bakati, “Umundu uyu atafumite kwa Chala ukunangannya ululaghilo lwa lisiku lyakutusya.” Loli bamo bakayugha bakati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">“Imba umundu wa mbibi angabomba ifiswigho? Po bakagabingana bene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bakayugha sona ku mundu umufwamaso yula bakati, “Imba uwe ukuyugha choni nisya mundu uyu, pakuti ukuti akakwighula amaso?” Akamula akati, “We musololi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Abalongosi aba Chiyuda batakalondagha pakusubila ukuti akaba mufwamaso, sona ipano akutesya, mupaka bakabitisya abapapi ba yo akighuka amaso, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />bakabalalusya abene akati, “Imba uyu mwana winyu, yo mukuti akapapiwa mufwamaso, po akutesya buli buli?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Abapapi bake bakamula bakati, “Tusimenye ukuti mwana witu, sona tusimenye ukuti akapapiwa mufwamaso, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />loli tutakumanya namo akutesekesya ipano, pamo tutakumumanya yo akamwighula amaso ghake, mulalusye yuyo. Pakuti wepe we songo angiyughila mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abapapi bake bakayugha isi chifukwa chakuti bakaboghopagha abalongosi ba Chiyuda, pakuti ablongosi aba Chiyuda bakapangana kale ukuti umundu wesi yo akwisa pakwitikisya ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu, akwisa pakwepusiwa munyumba yakwiputilamo. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Cho chifukwa abapapi bake bakayugha bakati, “We mundu usongo, mumulalusye yuyo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Po bakamwitisya sona ulwa bubili umundu yo akaba mufwamanso nukuyugha ukuti, “Lapa pamaso pa Chala ukuti ukwisa pakuyugha ubwanaloli. Utwe tusimenye ukuti umundu uyo wambibi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Po umwene akamula akati, “Pakuti wambibi, ndasimenye. Ichindu choka cho njimenye chakuti ngaba mufwamaso, loli ipano ngutesya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Po bakamulalusya umwene bakati, “Imba abombite choni ku kwako? Akakwighula buli buli amaso ghako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Akabamula abene akati, “Mbabusisye kale, loli mutakulonda ukwifwa. Imba choni cho mukulonda ukuti mwifwe sona? Imba numwe mukulonda ukuba bamanyili bake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Po abene bakamutuka bakati, “Uwe we mumanyili wa mundu uyu, loli utwe twe bamanyili ba Mozesi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Tusimenye ukuti u Chala akayugha nu Mozesi, loli isya mundu uyu tutasimenye, nako afumite tutamenyeko!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Umundu yula akabamula akati, “Ichi chakuswighisya ngani pakuti umwe mutamenyeko ko akafuma, loli akanyighula amaso. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Utwe tusimenye ukuti u Chala atakwifwa abambibi, loli akwifwa mundu wesi yo akwiputa u Chala nukubomba syo akulonda. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ukwandila po pabwandilo bwa chisu chapasi tutifwilepo lumo ukuti umundu amwighula amaso yo akapapiwa mufwamaso. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Pala umundu uyu atakafumagha kwa Chala, atangabomba nachimo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Abene bakamula bakati, “Uwe ukapapiwa mumbibi, imba ukulonda ukutumanyisya utwe?” Po bakamufumya kusi munyumba ya kwiputilamo.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubufwamaso mwambepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />U Yesu akifwa ukuti umundu yula bamufumyamo, bo amwagha akati, “Ukumusubila u Mwana wa Mundu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Akamula akati, “Imba we wenu yuyuyo, Malafyale, mbusya ukuti nune musubile.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />U Yesu akamubusya akati, “Wa mutesya, yo akuyugha nawe weyuyo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Po umundu yula akati, “Malafyale, ngusubila.” Po akamufughamilila nukumwiputa.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />U Yesu akati, “Ngisa muchisu chapasi pakulonga umwakuti abafwamaso batesye, sona bo bakutesya babe bafwamaso.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Abafalisayi bamo bo bakaba nawe pala-pala bakifwa amasyu ghake nukumulalusya ukuti, “Imba utwe twe bafwamaso?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />U Yesu akati, “Pala mukabanga bafwamaso ngali te mwe bambibi. Loli mukwiyugha mwebene ukuti, Tukutesya, cho chikung’anamula ukuti mukali mwe bambibi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Ichili cha mulisya ng’osi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Naloli, ngubabusya umwe ukuti wesi yo atakwendela pamulyango wachibagha cha ng’osi, loli akwendela musila iyingi, yuyuyu mwifi, sona mufyeka. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Loli umundu yo akwingila pamulyango, yuyuyu yo mulisya ng’osi. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Umulindilili akumwighulila umulyango wa chibagha chila. Ing’osi sikwifwa isyu lyake bo akusitisya amalita ghabo nu nukusifumya kusi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Bo akusifumya syosi kusi, umwene akutangila kundasi, isyene ing’osi sikumukonga munyuma pakuti silimenye isyu lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Umugheni sitakwisa pakumukonga, loli sikwisa pakumukinda pakuti sitisubile nisyu lya mugheni.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Ichili ichi u Yesu akayugha ku kwabo, loli abene bakapotwa pakusyaghannya syo akababusyagha.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu Mulisya Umwisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />U Yesu akababusya sona akati, “Naloli ngubabusya ukuti une ne mulyango wa ng’osi. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bosi bo bakisa bongali pakwisa bo bifi, sona bafyeka, loli ing’osi sitakabifwila. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Une ne mulyango, pala wesi yo akwingila ukwendela mu mwangu akwisa pakupokiwa, akwisa pakwingila nukufuma, po akwisa pakulyagha isote. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Umwifi akwisa pakwiba, pakughogha nu kunangannya bubu. Une nisile ukuti babe nubumi, sona babe nabo ubwakwisula.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Une ne mulisya ng’osi umugholoke, umulisya umugholoke akufwila ing’osi syake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Umundu waganyu bubu yo te mulisya, sona ing’osi te syake, pala ayitesya imbumbi, akusileka ing’osi nukukinda, po imbumbi sikukolapo ing’osi sila nukusinyambannya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Umwene akukinda pakuti wambombo bubu, sona atakusipwelele ing’osi sila. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Une ne mulisya ng’osi umugholoke, simenye ing’osi syangu, sona syope ing’osi syangu simenye, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />ukuyana bubu namo u Tata amanyile, sona nune mumenye u Tata, sona ngubika ubumi bwangu chifukwa cha ng’osi sila. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Indi ni ng’osi syo site sya muchibagha ichi. Syope bubu mbaghile ukusisenya. Sikwisa pakwifwa isyu lyangu, po sikwisa pakuba lutimo loka nu wakulisya weka.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />U Tata anganite une, chifukwa ngwibika ubumi bwangu ukuti nise mbupokele sona. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Ataliko nuyumo yo angafyula ubumi bwangu. Loli ngwibika ukuyana nu bwighane bwangu. Indi nu bulaghili pakubupeleka ubumi, sona indi namaka pakubusenya sona. Ichi cho u Tata akandamulila ukuti imbombe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Aba Yuda bo bakifwa amasyu agha bakanda sona pakugabingana. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Abingi bakayugha bakati, “Ali ni mbepo imbibi, sona apenite. Imba choni cho mukumuteghelesya?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Abangi bakayugha bakati, “Agha ghatangaba masyu gha mundu yo ali ni mbepo imbibi. Imba imbepo imbibi yingamwighula amaso abafwamaso?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aba Yuda bakumukana u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Mu Yelusalemu mukaba ulusekelo lwa kuyipeleka inyumba ya Chala, aka kakaba kabalilo kalupepo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />U Yesu akenda kendagha bubu Mumbenu ya nyumba ya Chala, yo yikwitisiwa ukuti yombenu ya Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Aba Yuda bo bakamusyungulila bakayugha ukuti, “Imba ukwisa pakwendelela pakutukayikisya mupaka lighi? Utubusye pabwelu pala naloli we Kilisitu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Mbabusisye kale loli mutakusubila. Imbombo syo ngubombela mwilita lya Tata wangu, sikusimikisya isya une, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />loli mutakusubila pakuti te mwe ng’osi syangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ing’osi syangu sikwifwa isyu lyangu, po nune simenye, sona syope sikungonga. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ngusipa ubumi bwa bwile na bwile, sona sitakwisa pakufwapo lumo, nayumo umundu yo angasifyula munyobe syangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />U Tata yo ambile ing’osi, mukulu ngani ukukila fyosi, ataliko nayumo yo angafyula munyobe sya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Une nu Tata tuli weka.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Po aba Yuda bakaseba sona aba amabwe ukuti ba munyuke nagho. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Nabalangisya imbombo inyingi inyisa, isya Tata wangu. Chifukwa cha mbombo yiki yo mukunyuka namabwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Po aba Yuda bakamula bakati, “Tutakulonda pakukunyuka na mabwe chifukwa cha mbombo inyisa, loli chifukwa cha kumusamula u Chala, uwe we mundu bubu, loli ukwipela wemwene pakuba we Chala!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Imba sitasimbiwe mu ndaghilo sinyu ukuti, Une nayughite ukuti, ‘Umwe mwe ba chala?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Pala akabitisya ukuti bo ba chala, ku bo amasyu gha Chala ghakabisila, sona syo sisimbiwe sitakafumamo lumo, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />imba mungayugha buli nisya yo u Tata akamusala nu kumutuma muchisu chapasi ukuti, ‘Ukumusamula u Chala,’ chifukwa nayugha ukuti, ‘Une ne mwana wa Chala?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Pala ndakubomba imbombo sya Tata wangu, po mutakasubile une. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Loli pala ngubomba, napo mutakusubila une, musubile bubu imbombo, umwakuti mungamanya nu kwifwisya ukuti u Tata ali mumwangu sona nune indi mwa Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Abene bakaghesya sona pakumukola, loli akafyundumula munyobe syabo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Akanyokela sona kwisila kwa lusoko lwa Yolodani, kubuyo bo u Yohani akosyagha pabwandilo, po akikala kula kula. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Abandu abingi bakisa kukwake bakayugha bakati, “U Yohani atakabombapo nachimo ichiswigho, loli syosi syo akayughagha isya mundu uyu sikaba syanaloli.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Abandu abingi kula kula bakamusubila u Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Ubufwe bwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Pakabako umundu yumo ilita lyake akaba Lazalo, yo akabinagha, akafumagha mu Betaniya, mukaya ko u Maliya nu wamwabo u Malita bakikalaghamo. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Akaba we Maliya yo akamupakasya u Malafyale amafuta gha kunungila, nukumupuputa mufinama fyake ni ching’wili chake, yo umuyemba wake u Lazalo akaba mubine. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Abayemba bake bakatuma indumi kwa Yesu ukuti, “Malafyale, umumanyani wako umughaniwa abinite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Bo u Yesu ifwa isi akati, “Ububine ubu te bwakuti angafwa nabo, loli bwa kuti u Chala aghindikiwemo, sona ukuti u Mwana wa Chala apokele ubughindikiwa chifukwa cha bubine bububu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Po u Yesu akamughana u Maliya nu wamwabo wake u Malita sona nu Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />loli bo Ifwa ukuti Lazalo mubine, akikalako amasiku aghangi mabili ko akaba. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Po akababusya abamanyili bake akati, “Sa tubuke sona mu Yudeya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Abamanyili bake bakayugha bakati, “We Mumanyisi, lululu abalongosi aba Yuda balondagha pakukusumba na mabwe, imba ukulonda pakunyokelako sona?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Umusanya ghuli nama awala twelovu, wesi yo akwenda nu musanya atakwipunula pakuti akutesya ubwelu bwa muchisu chapasi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Loli pala yumo akwenda nu busiku, yo akwipunula chifukwa ate nu bwelu mu mwake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Bo ayugha isi, akabukilila pakubabusya ukuti, “Umumanyani witu u Lazalo aghonite bubu utulo, loli ngubuka pakumulamusya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Po abamanyili bakamwamula bakati, “Malafyale, pala akali ali mutulo, akwisa pakuba akisa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Abene bakinong’onagha ukuti akuyugha tulo twa bwanaloli, loli u Yesu akang’anamula ukuti u Lazalo afwile. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Po u Yesu akayugha pabwelu akati, “U Lazalo afwile, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />loli chifukwa cha umwe hobokite ngani ukuti ndakabako, pakuti musubile. Twende kukwake.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Po u Tomasi, (yo akitisiwagha ukuti we mapasa) akababusya abamanyili abanine akati, “Twende poka nawe, ukuti tufwile poka nawe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu we kusyuka sona we bumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Bo u Yesu afika akagha u Lazalo aghonamo kale mwipumba amasiku folo. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Akaya ka Betaniya kakaba papipi nu Yelusalemu, amakilomita aghakukwana papipi matatu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />po aba Yuda abingi bakisa pakubasubasya u Malita nu Maliya chifukwa cha bufwe bwa muyemba wabo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Bo u Malita ifwa pakuti u Yesu akwisa, akafuma kusi pakukomana nawe, loli u Maliya akasyala munyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />U Malita akamubusya u Yesu akati, “Malafyale, pala ukabangapo papapa, ngali umuyemba wangu atafwile! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Sona napo ipano simenye ukuti chosi cho mukusuma ukufuma kwa Chala, u Chala ayukubapa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />U Yesu akamubusya u Malita akati, “Umuyemba wako akwisa pakusyuka sona kubufwe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />U Malita akamula akati, “Simenye ukuti akwisa pakusyuka sona kubufwe pisiku lyabumalilo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />U Yesu akamubusya akati, “Une ne kusyuka nu bumi. Wesi yo akusubila mumwangu akwisa pakuba nu bumi napo angafwa, pope akwisa pakuba mumi, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />sona wesi yo mumi akusubila mumwangu atakwisa pakufwa lumo. Imba ukusubila isi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />U Malita akayugha akati, “Inga, Malafyale, ngusubila ukuti uwe we Kilisitu, u Mwana wa Chala, yo bakatingi akwisa muchisu chapasi ichi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Bo u Malita amala pakuyugha isi, akanyokela pakumwitisya u wamwabo u Maliya nukumubusya kumbali ukuti, “Umumanyisi ali kuno akukwitisya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Bo u Maliya ifwa isi, akanyamuka umwalubilo, akabuka kwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />U Yesu akaba akali atafikite mukaya kala, loli akaba akali pabuyo bo u Malita akakomana nawe. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Aba Yuda bo bakaba poka nu Maliya munyumba pakumusubasya, bo bamutesya u Maliya anyamuka umwalubilo u kufuma kusi, bakamukonga ukuti akubuka kumapumba pakulila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Bo u Maliya afika pabuyo bo u Yesu akaba, po akamutesya, akafughamila mufinama fyake. Akamubusya akati, “Malafyale, pala ukabangapo ngali umuyemba wangu atafwile.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Bo u Yesu amutesya u Maliya akalila, sona na ba Yuda bo bakaba poka nu Maliya bope bakalilagha, umoyo wake ghukisula ngani ni chitima, nu kutamiwa ngani, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />sona akabalalusya akati, “Imba musilite kwighi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Abene bakamwamula bakati, “Malafyale, twende utesyeko.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />U Yesu akalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Po aba Yuda bakati, “Tesya mo akamughanila.”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Loli bamo bakati, “Imba te weyo akamwighula amaso umufwamaso? Imba atangabomba chimo ukuti u mundu uyu atakafwe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akumususya u Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />U Yesu akatamiwa ngani sona, po akabuka kwipumba lyo likaba mbako, bakighalilapo nibwe pa mulyango. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />U Yesu akayugha akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">“Fumyapo ibwe” U Malita umuyemba yo akafwa yula akamubusya u Yesu akati, “Malafyale akabalilo aka abaghile pakununga akabibi, pakuti aghonamo amasiku folo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Imba ndakababusya ukuti pala mukusubila mukwisa pakubutesya ubughindikiwa bwa Chala?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Bakafumyapo ibwe lila. Po u Yesu akatesya kumwanya nukuti, “Tata, ngukupalisya pakuti wanyifwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Simenye ukuti mukunyifwa akabalilo kosi, loli nguyugha isi chifukwa cha bandu bo bali pano, umwakuti basubile ukuti uwe we ukanduma.”<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Bo ayugha isi, akitisya nisyu lya pamwanya ngani akati, “Lazalo fumamo!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Po umundu yo akafwa yula akafumamo, annyembeteliwe nu mwenda mufinama na munyobe, sona akapinyiwa ni chitambala kumaso. U Yesu akababusya akati, “Musatule mumuleke abukaghe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aba Yuda bakupangana pakumughogha u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Aba Yuda abingi bakisa kwa Maliya, bo batesya syo u Yesu akabomba, po bakasubila mu mwake. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Loli bamo mu mwabo bakabuka ku ba Falisayi, nukuyugha syo u Yesu akabomba. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Po abalongosi ba baputi naba Falisayi bakitisya ulukomano nukuyugha ukuti, “Tubombe choni utwe? Pakuti umundu uyu akubomba ifiswigho ifingi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Pala tungamuleka bububu, abandu bosi bakwisa pakumusubila, po aba Loma bakwisa pakunangannya inyumba ya Chala nu luko lwitu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Po yumo mumwabo akaba we Kayafa, yo akaba muputi usongo ichinja chila chila akayugha akati, “Mutakumanya ichindu nachimo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Imba mutangifwisya ukuti chisa ukuti umundu yumo abafwile abandu, nukuti uluko losi lunangike. <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Loli atakayughagha mwene, loli ngati muputi usongo ichinja chila chila, akasololagha nganila ukuti u Yesu akwisa pakufwila uluko lwa ba Yuda, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />te kokuti uluko lwabo lwene, loli pakubungannya abana ba Chala bo banyambanite.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ukufuma isiku lila lila bakapanganamo bangamughoghela. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Po u Yesu atakalondagha pakwenda pabwelu mukaya ka mu Yudeya, loli bakafumamo nukubuka mukaya kupipi ningolongo, mukaya ka Efulayimu, akikala kulakula poka nabamanyili bake.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Loli bo u Leskelo lwa Pasaka lwa Chiyuda lwapalamila, po abingi bakakwela ukufuma mutwaya nukubuka mu Yelusalemu bo u lusekelo lutafikite ulwa kwiswepesya bene. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Abene bakamulondagha u Yesu, bakalalusannya bene bene bo bakimilila Munyumba ya Chala bakati, “Umwe mukwinong’ona choni? Imba batakwisa ku Lusekelo lulu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Loli abalongosi ba baputi naba Falisayi bakalaghila ukuti, pala yumo amenyeko ko ali, yo abaghile ukutubusye, ukuti tumukole.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akupakasiwa amafuta mukaya ka Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayi26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Bo ghasyala amasiku sikisi ukuti u Luselo lwa Pasaka lubombiwe, u Yesu akisa mu Betaniya ko akikalagha u Lazalo, yo u Yesu akamususya kubufwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Bakamupiyila ichakulya cha pamasuba, u Malita weyo akababombela, u Lazalo akaba wa bamo bo bakalyanga poka nu Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Po u Maliya akasenya amafuta agha pamutengu aghakunungila gho ghakapangia ku chibwaliwa cha nalidi, akamupakasya u Yesu mufinama fyake nukumupuputa ni ching’wili chake mufinama, munyumba mosi mukisula numunusi wa amafuta. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Loli yumo wa bamanyili bake, u Yudasi Sikaliyoti, yo akaya pakumubika u Yesu munyobe sya balughu, akalalusya akati, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Imba choni cho amafuta agha ghatakaghulisiwa namalipilo agha kuyana nichinja?” Ukuti mubape abapina indalama. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Akayugha isi, te chifukwa chakuti akabapakisyagha abapina, loli chifukwa chakuti akaba mwifi akasunga inyambi ya ndalama nu kwibamo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />U Yesu akati, “Muleke umukolo uyu mwene, pakuti akasungila amafuta mupaka pisiku lya kusilila. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Pakuti mukuba nabo abapina akabalilo kosi, loli mutakuba nune akabalilo kosi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulubatiko lwa kumughoghela u Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Bo ichilundilo ichikulu cha ba Yuda chasimanya ukuti u Yesu ali ku Betaniya, bakisa, batakisila chifukwa cha Yesu, loli bakisa pakumutesya u Lazalo, yo u Yesu akamususya ku bufwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Loli abalongosi ba baputi bakitikana sona nisya kumughogha u Lazalo wepe, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />chifukwa cha yuyo aba Yuda abingi bakafumako kukwabo, nukumusubila u Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akwingila mu Yelusalemu nu bupoti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayi21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ilya ningelo lyake ichilundilo bandu abingi chikisa ku lusekelo, bo bifwa ukuti u Yesu akwisa mu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Po bakasenya utusamba twa mabale bakafuma nu kubuka pakukomana nawe, bakakolelagha ukuti, “Hosana! Musayiwa uyu yo akwisa mwilita lya Malafyale! Musayiwa u Malafyale wa Isilayeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />U Yesu akamwagha umwana wa mbunda nu kukwelapo, ngati samo sisimbiliwe,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Mutakoghopaghe mwe bandu ba mu Ziyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">u Malafyale winyu akwisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">bo akwelite pa mwana wa mbunda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Abamanyili bake batakasyaghannya hagha pabwandilo, loli bo aghindikiwa po bakakumbukila ukuti isi sikasimbiwa nisya yuyo, nu kumubombela sisisi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Po ichilundilo cho chikaba poka nawe bo akumwitisya u Lazalo ukuti fuma mwipumba, sona nukumususya kubufwa chikabukilila pakufumusya amasyu. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Chifukwa chakuti abandu abingi bakifwa ukuti abomba ichiswigho chila, bakabuka pakomane nawe. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Po aba Falisayi bakayughisannya bene bene ukuti, “Mukutesya, tutakukabapo nachimo, tesya abandu bosi kakumukonga.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aba Giliki bamo bakumulonda u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Aba Giliki bamo bo bakaba mu bandu bo bakabuka pakwiputa mu Yelusalemu ku lusekelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Abene bakabuka kwa Filipu yo akaba wa mukaya ka Betisayida mubuyo bwa Galileya bakati, “Malafyale, tukulonda tumutesye u Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />U Filipu akabuka nu kumubusya u Andeleya, po bakabuka poka pakumubusya u Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Akabalilo kafika ukuti u Mwana wa Mundu apokele ubughindikiwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ngubabusya ubwanaloli ukuti imbeyu ya ngano yikuba yoka, pene po yitawilile pilongwi nu kufwa. Loli pala yafwa, po yikwela iseke inyingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Yo abughanite ubumi bwake akwisa pakubutagha, yo abubengite ubumi bwake mu chisu chapasi ichi akwisa pakubusunga ubumi bwa bwile na bwile <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Pala yo akumbombela une, abaghile pakungonga une, sona ko indi une koko wepe akwisa pakuba mubombi wangu, pala yo akumbombela une, u Tata akwisa pakumughindika.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akuyugha nisya kufwa kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Ipano umoyo wangu ghukutamiwa ngani, imba ngwisa pakuyugha choni? Tata, mboka ku kabalilo aka? Awe, cho chifukwa nisile akabalilo kaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata, ghindika ilita lyako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Po isyu likafuma kumwanya likati, “Nalighindika kale, po ngwisa pakulighindika sona.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Po ichilundilo cho chikimilila pala pala chikifwa isyu, po bamo bakayugha bakati ko kupaya kwa fula. Abangi bakati, “Wandumi akuyugha nawe!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Isyu ili litakifwika chifukwa cha nene, loli likifwika chifukwa cha umwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Ipano kabalilo ka kulongiwa kwa chisu chosi ichapasi, ipano umulaghili wa chisu chapasi akwisa pakutaghiwa kusi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Une bo nguyakwesiwa ukufuma muchisu chapasi, ngwisa pakughusila abandu bosi kukwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Akayugha isi pakubonesya mo akwisa pakufwila.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Po ichilundilo chikamwamula ukuti, “Tukifwa utwe indaghilo ukuti u Kilisitu akubako bwile. Po umwe mukuyugha buli, ukuti u Mwana wa mundu akwesiwaghe? Po u Mwana wa mundu we wenu?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />U Yesu akababusasya akati, “Ubwelu bukali buli numwe papala bubu. Endagha bo mukali muli nabo ubwelu, ukuti ichisi chitakabaghe, yo akwenda muchisi atakumanya nako akubuka. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Musubile mu bwelu po muli nabo, ukuti mube bana ba bwelu.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Ukusita kusubila kwa bandu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Bo u Yesu ayugha isi, akafumapo nu kubwama. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Napo akabomba ifiswigho ifingi ngati ifi pamaso ghabo, loli pope batakamusubila, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />pakuti amasyu gha musololi u Yisaya ghakwanilisiwe gho ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Malafyale, we wenu yo akusubila ukulumbilila kwitu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Pamo we wenu yo amaka gha Malafyale ghamubonekela.<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Chifukwa ichi batakamusubila. Pakuti u Yisaya akayugha sona akati,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Akabighalila amaso ghabo nukukasya imyoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ukuti amaso ghabo ghatakatesyaghe ukuti ukwifwisya ni nyinong’ono yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">batangisa ku kwangu ukuti imbaposye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />U Yisaya akayugha isi chifukwa bo akabutesya ubughindikiwa bwa Yesu, nukuyugha nisyake. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Napo sikaba bubu, abalongosi aba Chiyuda abingi bakamusubila u Yesu, loli chifukwa cha ba Falisayi batakitikisya pa bwelu, pakuti bakoghopagha ukuti bangisa babafumyemo munyumba sya kwiputilamo, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />pakuti bakighana pakupaliwa na bandu, pakukila ukupaliwa nu Chala.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha Yesu ghakwisa pakubalonga abandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Po u Yesu akakolela ngani akati, “Yo akusubila une, atakusubila une nemwene, loli akumusubula nayo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yo akundesya une, amutesya sona nayo akanduma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Une ngisa ngati bwelu pa chisu chapasi, ukuti yo akusubila une atakikale muchisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Pala yo akwifwa amasyu ghangu loli atakwifwila, yo ndakwisa pakumulonga, pakuti ndakisa pakulonga ichisu cha pasi loli ngisa pakuchipoka. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Umulongi alipo kuyo akungana une, sona atakughapokela amasyu ghangu, amasyu gho nayugha ghakwisa pakumulonga pisiku lya bumalilo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ndakuyugha ubulaghili bwangu, loli ubwa Tata yo akanduma une, yo akandamula une ukuti ningayugha, sona namo ngwisa pakuyughila. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Po simenye ukuti indaghilo syake sikutupa ubumi bwa bwile na bwile. Chifukwa syo nayugha, nayugha ngati mo u Tata akumbusikisya”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akubasukusya Abamanyili bake ifinama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Bo lutafikite u Lusekelo lwa Pasaka, u Yesu akasimanya ukuti akabalilo kake ka kwana akakufumila pa chisu chapasi ukubuka ku Wise. Po pakubaghana bo bakaba bake muchisu chapasi, akabaghana mupaka pabumalilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Bo bali pakulya ichakulya cha pamasuba, po u Mumyasi yula akabikamo kale mumoyo uwa Yudasi, umwana wa Simoni Sikaliyoti inyinong’ono isya kumubika munyobe sya balughu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />U Yesu akasimanya ukuti u Wise akamupa ifindu fyosi munyobe syake, nukuti akafuma kwa Chala, sona akunyokela kwa Chala, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />akanyamukapo po bakalya ichakulya chapamasuba, akafula ilaya lyake ilya kusi nukusenya umwenda wake nukwipinya mumusana wake. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Po akakusya amisi mwibeseni, nukwanda pakubasukusya abamanyili bake mufinama nukubapuputa umwenda gho akipinya nagho. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Akisa kwa Simoni Pitala, po u Pitala akayugha ku kwake akati, “Malafyale, imba we kusukusya mufinama fyangu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Syo ngubomba utangasimanya ulu uwe, loli uyu kusimanya mundasi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />U Pitala akayugha akati, “Utakwisa pakusukusya lumo finama fyangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Pala ndanga kusukusya uwe, bo tute poka nuwe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />U Simoni Pitala akayugha ku kwake akati, “Malafyale, te finama fyangu fyene, loli munyobe na kumutu kwangu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Yo pala oghite atakogha sona, loli ifinama fyene, umubili ghosi ghuswepite, loli te wesi mwa umwe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Pakuti akasimanya yo akuya pakumubika mu nyobe sya balughu, cho chifukwa akayugha ukuti, “Te mwe bosi muswepite.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Bo amala pakubasukusya mufinama fyabo, akafwala umwenda wake uwakusi, po akikala pabuyo bwake, akayugha ku kwabo akati, Imba mukusimanya syo imbabombile umwe? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mukunyitisya mukuti Mumanyisi sona Malafyale, mukuyugha momumo, momo mbelile. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Pala une, ne Malafyale pamo ne Mumanyisi ngubasukusya mu finama fyinyu, numwe mubagile pakusukusannya mu finama fyinyu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Pakuti mbapile ichifwanikisyo, chakuti numwe mubombe samo nababombela. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Naloli, ngubabusya umwe ukuti uwambombo atakuba lumo wapamwanya ukila umalafyale wake, pamo umutumiwa atakubapo lumo wapamwanya ukumukila yo akamutuma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Pala mufimenye ifindu fififi, po mwe basayiwa pala mukufimbomba.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Ndakuyugha isya umwe mwe bosi, une mbamenye bo mbasalile, ukuti cho chisimbiwe chikwanilisiwe, ‘Yo akulya nune ichakulya yo asambukile une.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Une ngubabusya umwe isi ipano, bo sikali sitabombiwe, ukuti pala sikuya pakubombiwa mukasubile ukuti, ‘Une nene.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Naloli ngubabusya umwe, wesi yo akamupokela yo ngamutuma, yo akumbokela nune, yo akumbokela une akumupokela yo akanduma une.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akuyughila nganila nisya kubikiwa munyobe sya balughu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayi26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Bo u Yesu ayugha isi, akatamiwa ngani mwambepo nukusimikisya ukuti, “Naloli ngubabusya umwe, yumo mwa umwe akuya pakumbika munyobe syabalughu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Po abamanyili bakalingisannya bene bene, nukuswigha ukuti imba akuyugha we wenu. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yumo mu bamanyili bake, yo u Yesu akamughana ngani, akikala papipi nu Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />U Simoni Pitala akamupalisya nukuyugha ukuti, “Mulalusye ka ukuyugha we wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Po yo akamweghamila u Yesu, akayugha ku kwake akati, “Malafyale, angaba we wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Yo ngumupa akamenyu ka chibama cho nasasila mumbale nu kumupa umundu, umundu yuyuyu bo weyuyo.” Po akasenya akamenyu ka chibama akasasila nu kumupa u Yudasi mwana wa Simoni Sikaliyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Bo u Yudasi apokela ichibama, u Satana akingila mu mwake. U Yesu akayugha ku kwake, “Syo ukulonda pakubomba, bomba lubilo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Po patakabapo nayumo pa bandu bo bakikala pakulya, yo akasyaghannya syo u Yesu akang’amulagha. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Pakuti u Yudasi akaba ninyambi yakusungilamo indalama, bamo bakinong’ona ukuti, u Yesu amatuma ukuti, “Kaghule fyo fikulondiwa pa lusekelo” Pamo ukuti abape fimo abapina.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Po, bo apokela akachibama, papapo na papapo akafuma kusi. Loli pakaba po pabusiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ululaghilo ulupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Bo u Yudasi afuma, u Yesu akuyugha akati, “Ipano u Mwana wa Mundu aghindikiwe, sona Chala akughindikiwa mu mwake, <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />pala u Chala akughindikiwa mu mwake, po wepe u Chala akwisa pakughindikiwa umwana mumwake, po akwisa pakughindikiwa papapo. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Mwe bana bangu kwasyala akabalilo kapala akakuba numwe. Mukuya pakundonda une, sonamo ngayughila ku ba Yuda, ipano nguyugha kukwinyu ukuti, ‘ko ngubuka mutabaghile pakwisako.’<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ipano ngubapa ululaghilo ulupya ulwa kuti, mughananaghe. Ngati mo une mbaghanile umwe, momo numwe mughananilaghe. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Pala mukughanana po bakwisa pakumanya abandu bosi ukuti mwe bamanyili bangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akayughila nganila ukuti u Pitala akwisa pakumukana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayi26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />U Simoni Pitala akamulalusya akati, “Malafyale, ukuya kwighi?” U Yesu akamula akati,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">“Ko ngubuka utakangonge ulu, loli ukwisa pakungonga panyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />U Pitala akayugha ku kwake akati, “Malafyale, imba choni cho ndabaghile pakukonga ulu? Une niyanisye pakufwa nuwe”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Imba naloli ukuya pakufwa chifukwa cha une?” Naloli nguyugha nuwe, ukuti bo u mukolwe atakokolikite, uyu kungana une katatu ukuti utamenye.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu yo sila yakubukila kwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Mutakatamiwaghe mumyoyo yinyu, mumusubile u Chala, sona musubile nune. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Munyumba ya Tata wangu muli ubuyo ubwingi ubwa kwikalamo. Pala butakabangamo ngali mbabusisye, nabuka pakubanosekesya ubuyo umwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Po pala ngubuka pakubanosekesya ubuyo umwe, ngwisa sona pakubasenya ukuti ko indi une koko numwe mukabe. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Po muyimenye isila ko ngubuka une.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />U Tomasi akayugha akati, “Malafyale, tutamenyeko ko ukubuka, po tungayimanya buli isila?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Une ne sila, ne bwanaloli, sona ne bumi, nayumo yo akwisa kwa Tata, loli pene po akwendela mumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Pala naloli mumenye une mubaghile mumumanye nu Tata wangu wepe, ukwanda ipano mwamumanya sona mwamutesya.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />U Filipu akayugha ku kwake akati, “Malafyale, tulange utwe u Tata, ukuti nutwe twikutisiwe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Filipu nali numwe akabalilo akatali, po nulu ukali utamenye une? Yo pala akundesya une yo akumutesya nu Tata, imba po choni cho ukuti, ‘Utulangisye utwe u Tata wako?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Utakusubila uwe ukuti une indi mwa Tata, sona wepe u Tata ali mumwangu? Amasyu gho ngubabusya umwe te ghangu, loli nu Tata yo ali mu mwangu akubomba imbombo syake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Musubile une pakuti nguyugha ukuti indi mwa Tata, wepe u Tata ali mumwangu, pala mutakusubila une musubile chifukwa cha imbombo syene. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Naloli ngubabusya umwe, ukuti yo akusubila une, akwisa pakubomba imbombo syo une ngubomba. Wepe akwisa pakubomba, sona akwisa pakubomba imbombo ingulu ngani ukukila pa isi, chifukwa ngubuka kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Po fyosi fyo mukusumila mwilita lyangu, ngwisa pakubomba, pakuti u Tata aghindikiwe ukwendela mu Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Pala mukusuma fyosi ukwendela mwilita lyangu, une ngwisa pakubomba.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akulaghisya nisya Mbepo Mwikemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Pala munganite une, po mukonge indaghilo syangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Po une ngwisa pakusuma kwa Tata, po akwisa pakubapa umwe umwafwilisi uyungi, ukuti ikale numwe bwile na bwile, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />We Mbepo yo akafumbula ubwanaloli ukuyana nisya Chala. Ichisu chapasi chitangamupokela, chifukwa chitangamutesya pamo chitangamumanya, loli umwe mumumenye, pakuti akwikala numwe, sona ali mumwinyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Ndakwisa pakubaleka umwe ngati mwe bana balanda nguyukwisa sona ku kwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Pasyete papala bubu, po ichisu chapasi chitakwisa pakundesya sona, loli umwe mukwisa pakundesya, pakuti indi nu bumi, po numwe musukuba nubumi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Pisiku lililyo mukwisa pakumanya ukuti une indi mwa Tata, numwe muli mumwangu, sona une indi mumwinyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Yo pala akukonga ndaghilo syangu nu kwifwila. Po weyo anganite une, yo pala anganite une, akwisa pakughaniwa nu Tata wangu, nune ngwisa pakumughana sona ngwisa pakwibonesya nemwene kukwake.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />U Yudasi (te we Yudasi Sikaliyoti) akayugha nawe akati, “Malafyale, sili buli po ukuti ngwisa pakwibonesya nemwene kukwitu, loli muchisu chapasi awe?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />U Yesu akamula akati, Pala umundu yo anganite une, ayukwifwila amasyu ghangu. Po u Tata wangu ayukumughana, sona u Tata wangu poka nune tukwisa ku kwake nu kwikala nawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yo atanganite une atakughifwila amasyu ghangu. Po amasyu gho mukwifwa te ghangu, loli ghakufuma kwa Tata yo akanduma une.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Fyosi ifi nayugha bo ngali indi numwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Loli Umwafwilisi, u Mbepo Mwikemo, yo u Tata akwisa pakubatumila mwilita lyangu, yo akwisa pakubamanyisya nukubakumbusya ifindu fyosi fyo nayugha numwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Umutende ngubalekela umwe, ngubapa umutende wangu. Ndakubapa umwe ngati mo ichisu chapasi chikubapela. Mutakatamiwaghe mumyoyo yinyu pamo ukoghopa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mukanyifwa nguyugha numwe ukuti, Ngubuka, loli ngwisa sona ku kwinyu.’ Pala mukanganagha une, ngali muhobokite ukuti ngubuka kwa Tata, pakuti u Tata yo mukulu ngani ukukila une. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Po ipano ngubabusya nganila bo sikali sitabombiwe, ukuti pala sikwisa pakubombiwa mukasubilaghe. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Ndakwisa pakuyugha inyingi numwe, pakuti umulaghili wa chisu chapasi akwisa. Yo ate namaka papangu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />loli abandu ba muchisu chapasi bamanye ukuti mughanite u Tata, nukuti mbombe ngati mo u Tata akandamulila une.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Twende, tufumepo pabuyo ubu.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu yo likomu lya mambesya ilya bwanaloli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Une ne mambesya gha bwanaloli, po u Tata wangu yo mulimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kosi akasamba ko kali mumwangu, ko katakwela iseke akukafumyamo. Kosi akasamba ko kakwela iseke akapalandila, ukuti kongelele pa kwela iseke inyingi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Umwe muswepite kale nisyu lyo ngababusya umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ikala mumwangu, une nikale mumwinyu, ngati kasamba ko katabaghile ukwela iseke pakene, pene po kamamatile kwi komu lya mambesya. Numwe bubu mutangela iseke pala mutakwikala mumwangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Une ne likomo lya mambesya, umwe mwe samba syake. Yo pala akwikala mu mwangu, nune indi mumwake, weyo akwela iseke inyingi, ukusita une mutabaghile ukubombapo nachimo. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Pala umundu yo atakwikala mumwangu, akutaghiwa panja ngati kasamba, kafoka, isamba sikubunganikiwa nukutaghiwa pamulilo, po sikupya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Pala umwe mukwikala mumwangu, namasyu ghangu gha kwikala mumwinyu, suma fyosi fyo mukulonda, po fikwisa pakubombiwa ku kwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Pa isi u Tata wangu akughindikiwamo, ukuti mwele iseke inyingi, po mwilangisye mwebene pakuba mwe bamanyili bangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Ngati mo u Tata anganile une, momo nune mbaghanile umwe, mube mu lughano lwangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Pala mukwifwila indaghilo syangu, po mukwisa pakuba mu lughano lwangu, ngati mo ngukongela indaghilo sya Tata wangu, po ngwikala mulughano lwake.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Nayugha ifindu ifi numwe, umwakuti ukuhoboka kwangu kube mumwinyu, nukuti ulusekelo lwinyu lube lwakufikapo. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ululaghilo lwangu lo ulu, mughananaghe ngati mo une mbaghanile umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Atalipo nayumo umundu yo ali nu lughano ukukila pa ulu, ichakuti umundu apalekeke ubumi bwake chifukwa cha bamanyani wake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Umwe mwe bamanyani bangu pala mukubomba syo ngabalamula umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ndakwisa pakubitisya ukuti mwe bambombo, pakuti uwambombo atakusimanya syo u malafyale wake akubomba, loli umwe ngubitisya ukuti mwe bamanyani bangu, chifukwa fyosi fyo ngifwa kwa Tata ngababusya umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Umwe mutasalite une, loli une mbasalite umwe, sona mbasalite umwe ukuti mubuke nu kwela iseke, iseke syo sikwikalisya, umwakuti fyosi fyo mukusuma kwa Tata mwilita lyangu akwisa pakubapa umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ululaghilo lwangu lwakuti umwe mughananaghe.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu ba chisu chapasi bayubabenga abamanyili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Pala ichisu chikubabenga umwe, mumanye ukuti chikanda chambenga une, bo chikali chitababengite umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Pala mukaba ba muchisu chapasi ichi, po ichisu nge chibaghanite umwe ukuba mwe bake, loli chifukwa chakuti umwe te mweba muchisu chapasi muno, loli ngabasala ukufuma muchisu chapasi, cho chifukwa ichisu chapasi chibabengite umwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mukumbuke amasyu gho ngayugha ku kwinyu ukuti, ‘Uwambombo te wesongo ukumukila umalafyale wake.’ Pala bakafwima une, po bakwisa pa kubafwima numwe. Pala bakifwila isyu lyangu, po bayukubifwila numwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Loli fyosi ifi basukubabombela chifukwa cha lita lyangu, pakuti batakumumanya yo akanduma une. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Pala ndakisa pakuyugha nabo, ngali batakabomba imbibi, loli ulu katalipo akananilo aka mbibi syabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yo pala ambengite une, yo amubengite sona nu Tata wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Pala ndakabombagha pakati papabo syo nayumo yo akabomba, po ngali bate ni mbibi, loli akabalilo aka bafitesisye ifiswigho, pope batubengite twebosi une nu Tata wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Loli sisisi kabombiwa ukuti sikwanilisye syo sikasimbiwa mundaghilo syabo, ukuti, ‘Bakambenga ukusita ukuba ni chifukwa chimo.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Loli pala isile umwafwilisi, yo ngwisa pakubatumila ukufuma kwa Tata, we Mbepo wa bwanaloli, yo afumite kwa Tata, yo akwisa pakusimikisya nisya une. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Po numwe bubu mukusimikisya sona, pakuti mwali nune ukufuma ku bwandilo.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Syosi isi ngababusya umwakuti muleke pakutagha ulwitiko. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bakwisa pakubafumya munyumba sya kwiputilamo, sona kakwisa akabalilo ko wesi yo akubaghogha umwe akwisa pakwinong’ona ukuti akumubombela imbombo u Chala. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Po bakwisa pakubomba bububu chifukwa batamumenye u Tata, nune batamenye. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Loli nababusya ifindu fyosi ifi umwe, umwakuti bo akabalilo kabo akwisa, mukwisa pakukumbuka ukuti ngabasoka nisya babo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Imbombo ya Mbepo Mwikemo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Ndakababusya isi pabwandilo, chifukwa tukaba poka numwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Loli akabalilo aka ngubuka ku yo akanduma une, po nayumo uwa kundalusya une, ‘Ukuti ukubuka kwighi? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Pakuti mbabusisye fyosi ifi umwe, imyoyo yinyu yiswile nichitima. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Loli ngubabusya ubwanaloli, ukuti chisapo kukwinyu ukuti une ngufumapo. Pakuti pala ndangafumapo, po umwafwilisi atakwisa ku kwinyu. Loli pala nabuka, po ngwisa pakumutuma ku kwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Po umwene isa, akwisa pakusimikisya isya bandu ba muchisu chapasi nisya mbibi, nubwisa sona nisya bulongi, <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />bakupuba nisya mbibi chifukwa batakusubila une, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />bakupuba nisya bwisa, chifukwa ngubuka kwa Tata, po mutakuya payundesya sona une, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />bakupuba nisya bulongi, chifukwa umulaghili wa chisu chapasi ichi alongiwa kale.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Ngali indi nasyo inyingi isya kuyugha numwe, loli mutabaghile pakukiba ulu. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Loli bo u mbepo uwa bwanaloli isa, yo akwisa pakubalongosya ubwanaloli bosi. Atakwisa pakuyugha amasyu ghake, loli akwisa pakuyugha fyosi fyo ifwa, sona akwisa pakubabusya ifundu fyo fikwisa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Akwisa pakungindika une, chifukwa akwisa pakusenya fyo nguyugha nu kubabusya umwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Fyosi fyo u Tata ali nafyo fyangu. Chifukwa chake ngayugha ukuti u Mbepo ayukusenya fyo nayugha, nu kubabusya umwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubusulumannye bwa bamanyili buyukuba bubu kuhoboke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Pakabalilo akapala bubu mutakwisa pa kundesya sona, loli pala penda akabalilo akapala muyukundesya sona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Abamanyili bake bamo bakanda pakulalusannya bene bene ukuti, “Imba akung’anamula choni? Po akuyugha ukuti, ‘Kwasyala akabalilo akapala bubu mutakwisa pakundesya, ‘sona pala penda akabalilo kapala mukwisa pakundesya sona, ‘Chifukwa ngubuka kwa Tata.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Abene bakendele ukuyughisannya ukuti, Imba akung’anamula choni, ‘akabalilo kapala bubu? Utwe tutakwifwisya syo akayugha.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />U Yesu akasimanya ukuti bakalonda pakumulalusya sisisi, po akababusya akati, Imba mukulalusannya mwebene bene po ngayugha ukuti, Kwasyala akabalilo kapala mutakwisa pakundesya sona, loli pala penda akabalilo akapala muya kundesya sona? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ngubabusya ubwanaloli ukuti, mukwisa pakulila nu kusulumannya, bo ichisu chapasi chikusekela. Mukwisa pakuba ni chitima, loli ichitima chinyu chiyakuba lusekelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Bo umukolo akupapa umwana akwifwa ububafu, chifukwa akabalilo kake ka kwana, loli pala apapa umwana, akulufya ububafu chifukwa cha kusekela kwake ukuti apapa umwana pa chisu chapasi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Po sili bubu numwe, aka kabalilo kinyu aka chitima, loli ngwisa pakubatesya umwe sona, po imyoyo yinyu yikwisa pakusekela, po nayumo yo akwisa pakufumya ulusekelo lwinyu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Pisiku lililyo mutayakusuma nachimo ku kwangu. Ngubabusya ubwanaloli ukuti, u Tata wangu ayakubapa fyosi fyo mwasuma mwilita lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ukufika ipano mutasumitepo nachimo mwilita lyangu. Musume po mukwisa pakupokela, sona ukusekela kwinyu lukwanilisiwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubupoti muchisu chapasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nayugha numwe ifindu ifi mufyili, loli kakwisa akabalilo ko ndakwisa pakubombesya ifyili. Ngwisa pakubabusya pa bwelu isya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Pisiku lililyo muya ukusumila mwilita lyangu. Po ndakuyugha ukuti nguya pakubasumila kwa Tata, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />pakuti u Tata mwene weyo abaghanite umwe, chifukwa chakuti munganite une sona mwasubila ukuti une ngafuma kwa Chala. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Une ngafuma kwa Tata nisile mu chisu chapasi, pa kabalilo aka ngutila mu chisu chapasi ichi ngunyokela kwa Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Abamanyili aba Yesu bakayugha bakati, “Akabalilo aka ukuyugha pa bwelu, utakuyughila sona mufwili! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Akabalilo aka, twasimanya ukuti ufimenye findu fyosi, sona ukuti utakulonda yumo akulalusye amalalusyo, isi sikutepela utwe tusubile ukuti ukafuma kwa Chala.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Imba ipano po mwasubila?” <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Akabalilo ka kwisa, sona kafikite ko mukwisa pakunyambana, umundu wesi kunyumba yake, po mukwisa pakundeka nemwene, loli une ndemwene, chifukwa u Tata ali poka nune. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Une nababusya ifindu ifi umwe, ukuti mube nu mutende mumwangu chifukwa cha une, muchisu mukwisa pakitamiwa loli mube bakifu! Pakuti une nachipota kale ichisu chapasi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akubiputila abamanyili bake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Bo u Yesu ayugha ifindu ifi, akatesya amaso kumwanya nukwiputa ukuti, “We Tata akabalilo kafika, umughindike u Mwana wako, ukuti u Mwana wako akughindike uwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Pakuti akamupa ubulaghili ku bandu bosi, ukuti abaghile abape ubumi ubwa bwile na bwile bosi bo ukamupa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Po ubu bo bumi bwa bwile na bwile, bukung’anamula ukuti bakumanye we Chala wa bwanaloli wemwene, nukumumanya u Yesu Kilisitu yo ukamutuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Une nakughindika mu chisu chapasi pakumalisya imbombo yangu yo ukamba ukuti mbombe. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Tata, akabalilo aka ungindike une pamaso ghako, nubughindikiwa bo ngaba nabo poka nuwe bo ichisu pasi chikali chitapeliwe.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Une nakufumbula uwe ku bandu bosi bo ukamba ukufuma muchisu chapasi, bakaba bako, ukamba bosi une, sona bakaghifwila amasyu ghako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Ipano basimanya ukuti ifindu fyosi fyo ukamba une fikufuma ku kwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Pakuti une ngabapa abene amasyu gho ukamba une, sona bakaghapokela, sona basimenye ukuti une ngafuma ku kwako, po bakasubila ukuti uwe we ukanduma une.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Une ngubiputila, ndakwiputila ichisu chapasi, loli ngubiputila abandu bo ukamba uwe, pakuti bako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Fyosi fyo indi nafyo fyako, sona fyosi fyo uli nafyo fyangu, sona naghindikiwa ukwendela mu mwabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Une ndakwikala sona mu chisu chapasi, loli bene bo bali mu chisu chapasi, po une ngwisa ku kwako. Tata we mwikemo, basunge aba mwilita lyako bo wamba une, ukuti babe mundu weka ngati mo tubelile mundu weka. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Pakabalilo ko ngaba nabo mu chisu chapasi, ngabafighilila nukubasunga akisa mwilita lyo ukamba po nayumo mumwabo yo akasobela, loli mwene yo sikamubagila ukunanganika umwakuti amasimbo ghakwanilisiwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ngwisa ku kwako, loli nguyugha sisisi bo ngali indi muchisu chapasi, umwakuti babe nulusekelo lwangu lube lwakufikapo mu mwabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Une ngabapa isyu lyako, po ichisu chapasi chibabenga, pakuti te ba muchisu chapasi, ngati mo nune te ne wa muchisu chapasi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ndakusuma ukuti ubafumye muchisu chapasi, loli ukuti ubasungilile ku mubibi yula. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Abene te ba muchisu chapasi muno, ngati mo nune te ne wa muchisu chapasi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Ubapaghule nu bwanaloli, ukuti amasyu ghako ghanaloli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ngati mo ukandumila muchisu chapasi, po nune nabatuma muchisu chapasi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Chifukwa cha babo, ngwibika ku kwako, ukuti bope babe bakwipeleka mubwanaloli.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ulwiputo lwangu te lwabo bene. Loli ngubiputila sona bosi bo bakusubila chifukwa cha masyu ghabo, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />ukuti bosi babe mundu weka, Tata, ngati mo uli mumwangu, nune indi mumwako. Ngwiputa ukuti babe mumwitu ukuti ichisu chapasi chisubile ukuti ukanduma une. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Une nabapa ubughindikiwa bo ukamba une, ukuti bope babe weka ngati mo nutwe tubelile weka, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Une indi mumwabo nuwe uli mumwangu, ukuti ubupoka bwabo bubapele ukuba mundu weka ukuti ichisu chapasi chimanye ukuti ukanduma une, sona mbaghanite ngati mo unganile une.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tata, une ngulonda ukuti bo ukamba une babe nune ko indi, ukuti batesye ubughindikiwa bwangu bo ukamba une, chifukwa ukangana une bo nichisu chapasi chikali chitepeliwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tata, mugholoke, napo abandu ba muchisu chapasi ichi batakumenye uwe, loli une ngumenye uwe sona abamanyili aba basimenye ukuti uwe we ukanduma une. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Une nabamanyisya ilita lyako sona timbukilile pakubamanyisya ukuti ulughano lo uli nalo ku une lube mumwabo, sona nune imbe mumwabo.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Ukukoliwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayi26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Bo u Yesu amala pakwiputa, akafumapo na bamanyili bake nu kuloboka ikombe lya Kidiloni, kula kula kukaba umughunda, gho u Yesu poka na bamanyili bake bakingilamo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />U Yudasi yo akamubika munyobe sya balughu akamanyako kubuyo bula bula, chifukwa u Yesu bakakomanagha kabili kabili na bamanyili bake kula kula. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Po u Yudasi, akabuka ni chilundilo cha basilikali naba balindili ba balongosi ba baputi na bafalisayi, bakabuka banyamwile inyale, ifikoka, nifilwilo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />U Yesu, akasimanya ngani syosi syo sikwisa pakubombiwa ku kwake, po akabuka nukubalalusya ukuti, “Mukumulonda we wenu?<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bakamula bakati, “Tukumulonda u Yesu wamu Nazaleti”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">U Yesu akayugha nabo akati, “Nene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">U Yudasi yo akamubika u Yesu munyobe sya balughu, akimilila poka nabo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Bo u Yesu abamula ukuti, “Nene” bakanyokela munyuma nukuwa pasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />U Yesu akabalalusya sona akati, “Imba we wenu yo mukumulonda?” Po bakayugha bakati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">“U Yesu uwa mu Nazaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />U Yesu akabamula akati, “Une mbabusisye ukuti nene. Pala mukundonda une, baleka aba babuke.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Akayugha isi ukuti amasyu ghakwanilisiwe gho akayughagha ukuti, ‘Ndakamutaghapo nayumo pabosi bo ukamba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Po u Simoni Pitala akaghusa upanga nu kumuputula ikutu ilya kundilo lya wambombo wa baputi usongo. Ilita lya wambombo akaba we Malikusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />U Yesu akati kwa Pitala, “Bika mumo u panga munyambi yake! Imba ukwinong’ona ukuti ndakwisa pakung’wela ulubako ulwa ndamyo lo u Tata akamba une?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu pamaso pa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Po ichilundilo cha ba basikali ba Chiloma poka nu mulongosi wabo, na balindilili ba Chiyuda bakamukola u Yesu nukumupinya, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />bakanda pakabuka nawe kwa Anasi, yo akaba we tayifyala wa Kayafa. U Kayafa akaba muputi usongo ichinja chila chila. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />U Kayafa weyo akabalingannya abalongosi ba Chiyuda ukuti chisapo umundu weka afwile abandu bosi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pitala akumukana u Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69">Matayi26.69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />U Simoni Pitala nu mumanyili yumo bakamukonga u Yesu. Chifukwa umumanyili uyu akaba mumanyikwe ngani ku muputi usongo, po bakabuka nu Yesu pakaya ka muputi usongo, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />loli u Pitala akimilila kusi kumulyango. Po umumanyili uyungi yo akamanyikwa ngani kwa muputi usongo, akafuma nukuya pakuyugha nu mulindu yo akalindililagha pamulyango, po akamwingisya u Pitala. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Umulindu yo akalindililagha pamulyango akayugha kwa Pitala akati, “Imba te we yumo wabamanyili ba mundu uyu?” Akayugha akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">“Une te nene.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Abambombo na basilikali ba Chiyuda bakapemba umulilo wa mababu, chifukwa kakaba kabalilo kakutalala. Po bakimilila nu kota umulilo, u Pitala wepe akimilila pala pala, nukota nabo umulilo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umuputi usongo akumulalusya u Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Po umuputi songo akamulalusya u Yesu isya bamanyili bake, nisya chimanyisyo chake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />“U Yesu akamula akati, “Une ngayugha pabwelu mubandu bachisu chapasi. Ngamanyisya akabalilo kosi mu nyumba sya kwiputilamo na mu Nyumba ya Chala, mo aba Yuda bosi bakubungana poka, ndakayugha nachimo umwakufifa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Imba choni cho mukundalusya une? Balalusye bosi bo bakanyifwa une. Abene basimenye syo ngayughagha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Bo u Yesu ayugha isi, yumo mubalindili akamukoma u Yesu kumaso, akayugha akati, “Imba ungamwamula umuputi usongo bububu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Pala nayugha akabibi, po simikisyagha ububibi bo nayugha. Loli pala njughite ubwanaloli, imba choni cho ukungoma?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Po u Anasi akamutuma u Yesu bo apinyiwe kwa Kayafa, umuputi usongo.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pitala akumukana sona u Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayi26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />U Simoni Pitala akaba akali imilile akota umulilo mwene. Po bakamulalusya bakati, “Imba te we wa yumo wa bamanyili ba mundu uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Umwene akakana, nukuyugha ukuti, “Te nene.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumo uwa mbombo wa muputi usongo, umukamu wa mundu yo u Pitala akamuputula ikutu, akayugha akati, “Imba ndakakutesya nawe mu mughunda mula?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />U Pitala akakana sona, papapo na papapo umukolwe akakokolika.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu pamaso pa Pilati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matayi27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Po bakamusenya u Yesu pangelo ngani, ukufuma kwa Kayafa nukubuka nawe ku nyumba ya Chiloma. Po abalongosi ba Chiyuda batakingila nabo mu nyumba ya mulaghiliwa Chiloma, umwakuti batakinyasye, loli ukuti balye ulusekelo lwa Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />U Pilati akafumu kusi ku kwabo nukulalusya ukuti, “Imba nongwa yiki yo mwisila nu mundu uyu?<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bakamwamula bakati, “Pala umundu uyu atakaba ni nongwa, ngali tutisile nawe ku kwako.<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />U Pilati akati ku kwabo, “Musenye uyu mwebene, mumulonge ukuyana nu lulaghilo lwinyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Loli aba Yuda bakamula bakati, “Utwe tutakwitikisiwa ukughogha umundu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Isi sikabombiwa ukuti amasyu gha Yesu ghakwanilisiwe ukulangisya nisya bufwe bo akwisa pakufwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />U Pilati akingila sona mu nyumba ya mulaghili wa Chiloma, nu kumwitisya u Yesu. Akamulalusya akati, “Imba uwe we Malafyale waba Yuda?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />U Yesu akamula akati, “Imba ilalusyo ili lyafuma ku kwako, pamo bangi bakakubusya isya une?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />U Pilati akamula akati, “Imba une ne mu Yuda? Abaluko lwako na balongosi ba baputi bo bisile nuwe ku kwangu. Imba ubombite choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akamula akati, “Ubunyafyale bwangu tebwa muchisu chapasi, pala bukabagha bwa muchisu chapasi ichi, ngali abambombo bangu balwa ukuti ndakabikiwe munyobe sya balongosi ba Yuda. Loli ulu ubunyafyale bwangu te bwa muchisu muno.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />U Pilate akayugha ku kwake akati, “Po uwe we Malafyale bati?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">U Yesu kamula akati, “Momumo mo wayughila ukuti une ne Malafyale. Une ngapapiwa sona ngisa muchisu chapasi, ukuti mbasimikisye ubwanaloli. Wesi yo ali pabwanaloli, yo akwifwa masyu ghangu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />U Pilati akalalusya akati, “Ubwanaloli cho choni?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Syatumuliwa ukuti u Yesu aghoghiwe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayi27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Bo u Pilati ayugha sisisi akafuma sona, akabuka ku ba Yuda nukubabusya ukuti, “Une ndakumwagha ni nongwa nayimo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Loli muli numuteto wakuti mbasatulile umundu weka pa Lesekelo lwa Pasaka. Imba mukulonda ukuti mbasatulile u Malafyale waba Yuda?<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bakamula nu kukuta ukuti, “Umundu uyu awe! Loli u Balaba.” (U Balaba akaba mufyeka.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Po u Pilate akamusenya u Yesu, akalamula ukuti bamusyembe. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Abasilikali bakaluka imbumbu ya myifwa nu kufwika u Yesu ku mutu, bakamufwika umuselekesya umukesamile, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />bakisa ku kwake nukuyugha ukuti, “Mwaghona Malafyale waba Yuda!” Bakamukoma namapi kumaso.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />U Pilati akafuma sona kusi, akayugha nabo akati, “Tesya, nisa nawe ku kwinyu, ukuti mumanye ukuti ndamwagha ni nongwa nayimo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Bo u Yesu akafuma bo kafwalite imbumbu yamyifwa nu muselekesya umukesamile, u Pilati akayugha ku kwabo akati, “Mutesye umundu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Po abalongosi ba baputi naba balindilili ba Nyumba ya Chala bamutesya, bakakuta bakati, “Akomeleliwe! Akomeleliwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">U Pilati akayugha nabo akati, “Musenye mwebene muye mumukomele, une ndamwagha ni nongwa nayimo mu mwake.<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Aba Yuda bakamwamula u Pilati bakati, “Utwe tuli nululaghilo, ululaghilo lwitu lululu abaghile ukufwa, chifukwa akiyugha mwene ukuti Mwana wa Chala.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Bo u Pilate Ifwa amasyu agha, ubogha bukamukola ngani. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Akingila sona mu nyumba ya Chiloma nu kumulalusya u Yesu ukuti, “Ukufumila kwighi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Loli u Yesu atakamwamula nachimo. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />U Pilati akayugha akati, “Ukukana ukuyugha nune?” Utasimenye ukuti indi ubulaghili bwa kukusatulila uwe, sona indi nubulaghili bwa kukukomelela?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Utangaba nubulaghili nabumo papangu, pala utakapeghiwa ukufuma kumwanya, polelo yo akambika munyobe syako yo anangite ngani imbibi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Bo u Pilati ifwa isisisi akalondagha pakumwabula u Yesu, loli abalongosi aba Chiyuda bakakuta ngani bakati, “Pala ungamwabula umundu uyu, bote we mumanyani wa Kesali wesi yo akwipela pakuba we malafyale bo akususannya nu Kesali.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Bo u Pilate ifwa amasyu agha, akafuma kusi nu Yesu, nukwikala nawe pachitengo cha bulongelo, pabuyo bwa mabwe, bo muchihebeli ko kuti Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Loli likaba lisiku lya kutendekesya u Lusekelo lwa Pasaka, kakaba kabalilo ka pamusanya. U Pilati akababusya aba Yuda akati, “Tesya u Malafyale winyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Abene bakakuta ngani bakati, “Mufumyepo! Mufumyepo! Akomeliwe”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">U Pilati kati ku kwabo, “Imukomele u Malafyale winyu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Abalongosi ba baputi bakamula bakati, “Tute nu Malafyale nayumo, loli u Kesali mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Po akabalekela u Yesu munyobe syabo ukuti akomeliwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akukomeliwa pambinjika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayi27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Bo u Yesu anyamwile imbinjika yake, bakafuma nawe kusi ukwa kaya nukubuka kubuyo bo bukitisiwa ukuti, “Lifupa lya kumutu” (Muchihebeli bakuti, “Gologota”). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Kulakula bakamukola pambinjika, bakamukomela poka nabangi babili yumo kunyobe indilo uyungi kusyomi, u Yesu akaba pakati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />U Pilati akasimba amasimbo nukubika pambinjika, gho ghakasimbiwa ukuti, “U Yesu wa mu Nazaleti, U Malafyale waba Yuda. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Amasimbo ghagha ghakabelengiwa na ba Yuda abingi ngani, chifukwa ubuyo bo u Yesu akakameliwapo bukaba papapi na mukaya akakulu, ghakasimbiwa mu Chihebeli, mu Chilatini na mu Chigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Abalongosi ba baputi bakamubusya u Pilate bakati, “Utakasimbe ukuti, “U Malafyale waba Yuda, loli utingi, ‘Umwene akayugha akati une ne Malafyale waba Yuda.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />U Pilate akabamula akati, “Cho nasimba, nasimba mbela.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Bo abasilikali bo bamukomela u Yesu, bakasenya imyenda yake bakagabannya pa folo, umusilikali wesi akasenya ichigaba chake, sona bakasenya nu muselekesya wake. Loli u muselekesya wake ghutakaba nulusonwa nalumo ukufuma kumwanya mupaka pasi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Po bakayughisannya bene bene ukuti, “Tutakanyepule awe, loli tubombe amayele, ukuti tumumanye yo tighube wake, isi sikabombiwa ukuti ghakwanilisiwe amasimbo ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bakagabana amalaya ghangu bene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">sona bakapanga amayele pa musekekesya wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Po isi syo syo abasikali bakabomba.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Papipi nimbinjika ya Yesu ku kimilila ung’ina nu wamwabo, u Maliya umukasi wa Kuliyopasi nu Maliya Magadalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Bo u Yesu amutesya u Mayi wake pala, numumanyili yo akamughana imilile papipi, akayugha akati, “Wee mayi we, “Tesya u Mwana wako!”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Po akayugha kumumanyili akati, “Tesya umayi wako.” Ukufuma akabalilo kala kala, umumanyili yula akamusenya u Maliya nu kubuka nawe ku kwabo.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubufwe bwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayi27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Pa nyuma pa isi u Yesu, akamanya ukuti fyosi fyamala, sona nukuti amasimbo ghakwanilisiwe akati, “Indi ninyota.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Pakaba isonda inyisule nu bwalwa bwa mafili ubwakusapa, bakasenya isipanji nu kuyidwibika mubwalwa bwamafilu ubwakusapa. Nukuyisomeka kulutete nukumubika kumulomo kwake. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Bo u Yesu apokela u bwalwa bwa mafilu ubusape, akayugha akati, “Kwamala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Po akinamila umutu wake pasi nu kufwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakamulasa u Yesu nimbalala pa lubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Po likaba lisiku lya kwitendekesya isiku lya kutusya, ukuti umufimba wa Yesu ghutabe pambinjika pisiku lya kutusya (pakuti isiku lyakutusya likaba lisiku likulu ngani), abalongosi aba Yuda bakamulalusya u Pilati bakati, “Ifinama fyake fipyoliwe nukuti imibili yabo yifumepo pambinjika. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Abasilikali bakisa nukumupyola ifinama umundu uwa bwandilo, sona nifya munine yo bakakomeliwa poka nawe. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Loli bo bafika kwa Yesu, bakamutesya ukuti afwile kale, po bakatamupyola ifinama fyake. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Loli yumo uwa basilikali akamulasa ni mbalala mulubafu lwake, papapo ibanda namisi fikafuma. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Umundu yo akasitesya isi akasimikisya, sona ulusimikisyo lwake lwanaloli. Umwene asimenye ukuti akuyugha ubwanaloli, sona akusimikisya ukuti numwe bubu musubile. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Pakuti sisisi sikabombiwa ukuti amasimbo ghakwanilisiwe ukuti, “Nalimo ifupa lyake lyo likwisa pakupyoliwa” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Po sona amasimbo aghangi ghakuti, “Ba yukumutesyagha yo bamulasite.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukusiliwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayi27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Pa nyuma pa isi, u Jozefu uwa ku Alimatiya, yo akaba mumanyili wa Yesu kubusyefu, pakuti akaboghopagha abalongosi aba Yuda, akamusuma u Pilati ukuti aghufumye umubili wa Yesu. U Pilati akamwitikisya ukuti aghufumye, po akaya aghufumyapo umubili wake. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />U Nikodemu yo pabwandilo akabuka kwa Yesu pabusiku, wepe akisa nifyakunungila fyo bakuti Mila, fyo akongannya nu Aloyi, ubung’wamu bwake bukaba papipi sate kilogalamu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Abandu babili aba bakaghusenya umubili wa Yesu, nukughunnyembetela nimyenda poka nimilembo yakunungila, pakukonga imiteto yaba Yuda yibelile pakasilile. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ubuyo bo bakamukomelela u Yesu, mukaba umughunda, po umughunda ghula ghukaba nipumba ipya lyo umundu atakasiliwamo lumo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Chifukwa likaba lisiku lya kutendekesya isiku lya kutusya aba Yuda, sona ipumba likaba papipi lyo bakabika umubili wa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akusyuka kubufwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayi28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Pangelo ngani bo lyakinda isuku lya kutusya bo kukali ukucha, u Maliya Magadalena akalabila ukubuka kwipumba akatesya ukuti ibwe litilitepo pamulyango pipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Po akamukindilila u Simoni Pitala nu mumanyili yumo, yo u Yesu akamughana ngani, nukubabusya ukuti, “Bamufumisyemo u Malafyale mwipumba, tutakumanya nako bamubikite.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />U Pitala numumanyili yumo bakubuka kwipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bosi babili bakakindagha, loli umumanyili uyungi akakinda ukumukila u Pitala akaba wabwandilo ukufika kwipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Akunanamila nukuyitesya imyenda yo bakamunnyembetelela, loli atakingilamo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Po u Simoni Pitala yo akamukongagha, akafika akingila mwipumba. Akatesya imyenda yo bakamunnyembetelela yili mula mula, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />nichitambala cho bakamupinya u Yesu kumutu. Chitakaba poka numwenda ghula, loli chikipeteka pachene. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Po u mumanyili uyungi, yo akanda pakufika kwipumba, wepe akisa ingila mwipumba akatesya nu kusubila, <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />bakaba bakali bataghaghanisye amasimbo ghakuti u Yesu abaghile pakusyuka kubufwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Po abamanyili bakanyokela kunyumba syabo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akumubonekela u Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matayi28.9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Loli u Maliya akimilila kusi pimbumba nu kulila, bo akali akulila akananamila nukutesya mwipumba, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />po akabatesya abandumi babili bafwete imyenda imiswepu, bikile po umubili wa Yesu ghukaghona, yumo kumutu yumo kufinama. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Bakamulalusya umukolo yula bakati, “Wee mukolo, choni cho ukulila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Umwene akabamula akati, “Chifukwa bamufumisyemo u Malafyale wangu, sona ndakumanya nako bamubikite.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Bo ayugha isi, akaghalabukila kunyuma akamutesya u Yesu imilile, loli atakamumanya ukuti we Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />U Yesu akayugha kumukolo yula akati, “Wee mukolo, imba choni cho ukulila? Ukumulonda we wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Umwene akinong’onagha ukuti mulimi, akamubusya akati, “Malafyale, pala wewe umunyamwile mbusya ko umubikite, une nguya pakumusenya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />U Yesu akayugha ku kwake akati, “Maliya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Akaghalabuka nukuyugha muchihebeli akati, “Laboni!” (Cho chikung’anamula ukuti, “Mumanyisi”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />U Yesu akayugha akati, “Utakangolaghe une, pakuti ngali ndakwelite kwa Tata, loli buka kubamanyili ububasye ukuti nyamukite pakubuka kwa Tata wangu, yo we Tata winyu, kwa Chala wangu, sona u Chala winyu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />U Maliya Magadalena akabuka ku bamanyili akati, “Namutesya u Malafyale.” Sona akababusya ukuti weyuyo yo abumbusya ifindu fififi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akubabonekela abamaniyili bake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayi28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Isiku ilingi bo lyakila isiku ilya kutusya pakabalilo ka pamasuba abamanyili bakakomana poka munyumba. Ifighi fikaba fyighalile chifukwa bakoghopagha abalongosi ba Chiyuda. Po u Yesu akisa nukwimilila pakati pabo, akababusya akati, “Umutende ghube numwe!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Bo ayugha isi, akabalangisya inyobe syake napalubafu. Po abamanyili bake bakahoboka ngani bo bamutesya u Malafyale. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />U Yesu akayugha sona akati, “Umutende ghube numwe, ukuyana namo u Tata akandumila une, momo nune ngubatumila.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Bo ayugha isi, akabaputila umughi nukubabusya ukuti, “Pokela u Mbepo Mwikemo. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Pala mukubahobokela abandu imbibi syabo, bakuhobokeliwa, pala mutakubahobokela imbibi syabo batakuhobokeliwa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akumubonekela u Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />U Tomasi uwa yumo mubamanyili twelovu, yo bakamwitisyagha ukuti mapasa, atakaba nabo poka abamanyili po u Yesu akisa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Po abamanyili abangi bala bakamubusya bakati, “Twamutesya u Malafyale!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Loli umwene akababusya akati, “Pene po natesya amabala agha misumali munyobe syake nukubika akafingwi kangu, sona nukubika inyobe syangu palubafu lwake, ndakwisa pa kusubila.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Boghakinda amasiku eyiti abamanyili bake bakabuka sona munyumba, wepe u Tomasi akaba nabo mula mula. Napo ifighi fighalika, u Yesu akisa nukwimilila pakati, akayugha akati, “Umutende ghube numwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Po u Yesu akamubusya u Tomasi akati, “Bika akafingwi kako kuno, utesye inyobe syangu, senya inyobe yako umbike pa lubafu lwangu, utakabe wa kukayikila loli usubile.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />U Tomasi akamula akati, “Malafyale wangu, sona Chala wangu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Po u Yesu akamubusya akati, “Imba wasubila chifukwa wandesya une? Basayiwa bo bakusubila bo batatesisye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifundo iya libuku ili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />U Yesu akapela ifiswigho ifingi ngani pamaso gha bamanyili bake, fyo fitakasimbiwa mwibuku ili. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Loli ifi fisimbiwe ukuti musubile ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu, u Mwana wa Chala, sona pala mwasubila mube nubumi mwilita lyake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">U Yesu akubabonekela abamanyili seveni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Panyuma pa isi, u Yesu akababonekela sona abamanyili bake ku nyanja ya Tibeliyasi, akababonekela ngati musila iyi. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />U Simoni Pitala akaba poka nu Tomasi (yo bakatingi Mapasa), nu Nataniyeli yo akafumagha mukaya ka Kana mu Galileya, na bana ba Zebediya na bangi abamanyili babili bakaba poka. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />U Simoni Pitala akababusya abanine akati, “Nabuka pakuloba iswi.” Bakamwamula bakati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">“Tukubuka poka nuwe.” Bakafuma nukuya pakukwela mu bwato, loli ubusiku bulabula batakakolapo nasimo. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Bo kwacha pangelo, u Yesu akimilila mumbali mwa nyanja, loli abamanyili bake batakamumanyagha ukuti we Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />U Yesu akabalalusya akati, “Mwe bamanyani, imba muli nayo iswi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bakamwamula bakati, “Awe.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Akababusya akati, “Ponnya ichilepa chinyu kumbali ya nyobe indilo mubwato, timukole simo iswi.” Bo bakaponnya ichilepa chabo, po bakapotwa pa kughusa ichilepa chifukwa cha bwingi bwa swi.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Po umumanyili yo u Yesu akamughana ngani akamubusya u Pitala akati, “We Malafyale!” Bo u Simoni Pitala ifwa ukuti we Malafyale, akafwala ilaya lyake ilya kusi, pakuti akafula ilaya lya kusi, po akitaghila mumisi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Loli abamanyili abangi bakisa mubwato, bakughusa ichilepa cho chisula niswi. Batakaba pabutali na pabwima ubwa kuyana na mamita wanu handiledi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Bo baya pabwima bakatesya iswi pamulilo uwa amababu, sona ni chibama. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Sanasyo simo iswi syo mwakola losulu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Po u Simoni Pitala akingila mubwato akaghusila ichilepa pabwima cho chikasyala niswi ingulu, syo sikaba wanu handiledi fifite fili, napo sikaba nyingi ichilepa chitakanyepuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />U Yesu akababusya akati, “Sakuno tulye ichakulya chapangelo.” Nayumo umumanyili yo akamulalusyapo ukuti, “We wenu?” Chifukwa bakamumanya ukuti we Malafyale. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />U Yesu akisa, akasenya ichakulya nu kubapa. Sona akabomba bubu syope niswi.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Aka kakaba kabalilo kabutatu ukuti u Yesu ababonekele abamanyili bake bo asyuka ku bufwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akumunyokesya u Pitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bo bamala pakulya, u Yesu akamulalusya u Simoni Pitala akati, “Simoni, mwana wa Yohani, imba unganite une ukukila abanyako aba? U Simoni akamula akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">“Inga, Malafyale, usimenye ukuti une ngughanite uwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">U Yesu akati, “Lisya utwana twa ng’osi syangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Akamulalusya sona ulwa bubili akati, “Simoni Mwana wa Yohani, Imba unganite une?” U Simoni akamula akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">“Inga we Malafyale, usimenye ukuti ngughanite uwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Sunga ing’osi syangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />U Yesu akamulalusya ulwa butatu akati, “Simoni, Mwana wa Yohani, imba unganite une?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">U Pitala akasulumannya chifukwa u Yesu akamulalusya ulwa butatu ukuti, “Imba unganite une?” U Pitala akamula akati, “Malafyale, usimenye syosi. Usimenye ukuti une ngughanite uwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">U Yesu akamubusya akati, “Lisya ing’osi syangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Naloli ngukubusya uwe, bo we mupala ukafwala we mwene ulamba wako nukubuka wemwene kosi ko ukulonda, loli pala wisa waba mughosi ukwisa pakugholosya we mwene inyobe syako, po umundu uyungi akwisa pakufwika ulamba mumusana, nukubuka ko uwe utakulonda pakubukako.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(U Yesu akayugha sisisi pakumulangisya u Pitala mo akwisa pakufwila nu ukumughindikilamo u Chala.) Po akayugha ku kwake akati, “Ngonga!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu nu mumanyili uyungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />U Pitala akaghalabuka, akamutesya umumanyili yo u Yesu akamughana, akubakonga, yo akamweghamila u Yesu pachifuba bo bali pakulya ichakulya cha pabusiku akati, “Malafyale we wenu yo akwisa pakukubika munyobe sya balughu?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Bo u Pitala amutesya umumanyili yula, akalalusya akati, “Malafyale, buli isya mundu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />U Yesu akamwamula akati, “Pala ngulonda ukuti abe nubumi mupaka ngise, imba uli nasyo nimbombo yiki?” Ungonge une!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Amasyu agha ghakasata ku bamanyili bosi ukuti, “Umumanyili uyu atakwisa pakufwa. Loli u Yesu atakayugha ku kwabo ukuti atakwisa pakufwa. “Akati pala une ngulonda ukuti abe nubumi mpaka une ngise, imba uli nasyo nimbombo yiki?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Uyu yo mumanyili wa kusimikisya ifindu fififi, sona weyo akasimba, sona tusimenye ukuti ukusimikisya kwake kwa naloli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha bumalilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Pali sona ifindu ifingi fyo u Yesu akabomba. Pala fyosi fikasimbiwagha, ngwinong’ona ukuti pachisu chosi ichapasi nge patakaba ubuyo ubwa kukwana ubwakusungimo ama buku ghagha gho nge ghasimbiwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>